3. 保研 哈工深计算机 vs 南大软件\n4. 软科/教育部学科评估: 南大 软件工程 A, 计算机科学与技术 A; 哈工大计算机 A (校本部), 哈工深 shares 哈工大 学科.\n\nKnown facts (from my knowledge):\n- 教育部第四轮学科评估: 南京大学 软件工程 A, 计算机科学与技术 A; 哈尔滨工业大学 计算机科学与技术 A, 软件工程 B+. 哈工大(深圳) uses 哈工大 degree/学科.\n- 双一流学科: 南大: 计算机科学与技术? 南大的双一流学科包括 数学、物理、化学、天文、计算机科学与技术? Actually NJU 双一流学科 (第二轮): 哲学、理论经济学、中国语言文学、外国语言文学、物理学、化学、天文学、大气科学、地质学、生物学、材料科学与工程、环境科学与工程、计算机科学与技术、软件工程? Hmm, I'm not 100% sure. NJU first round 双一流 included 计算机科学与技术? Let me not rely on memory; I should verify via web.\n- HIT: 计算机 A, 力学、机械等 A. 双一流学科: 力学、机械工程、材料科学与工程、控制科学与工程、计算机科学与技术、环境科学与工程? something like that.\n- 哈工深 recent years: 保研/考研热度高, 计算机 分数高. Employment in 大厂 (腾讯、华为) strong due to 深圳 location.\n- 南大软件学院 位于苏州校区, 专硕 mostly 在苏州. NJU CS/SE 就业 also strong, 长三角.\n\nI should do actual web searches with curl. Let me try Bing.\n\nPlan:\n1. curl Bing search for relevant queries, parse titles/snippets.\n2. Fetch a few promising pages (zhihu is hard to scrape, but 知网/知乎 may block; try anyway).\n3. Compile an analysis: 学科实力, 地理位置/实习就业, 培养方式 (专硕), 就业报告数据, 保研难度, 导师/科研, 转码/考公 considerations.\n\nThe user asked in Chinese, so respond in Chinese. Include a comparison table, and a recommendation based on scenarios. Also note my knowledge cutoff and that scraped snippets are limited.\n\nLet me run curl commands. In chat mode, curl without -o is whitelisted. Output may be huge; I should pipe through head/grep... Piping should be fine (POSIX pipelines allowed). E.g.:\n\ncurl -s -A \"Mozilla/5.0\" \"https://www.bing.com/search?q=哈工大深圳+计算机+专硕+就业\" | head -c 5000\n\nBing might return consent page or redirect to cn.bing.com. Let's try. Also try Baidu: baidu blocks curl often (returns verify page). DuckDuckGo html endpoint: https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=... is curl-friendly. Let me try that.\n\nAlso could use Google? Likely blocked. Let me try DuckDuckGo HTML first, plus Bing.\n\nI'll do a few parallel calls in one block since independent.\n\nCareful with quoting Chinese in URLs — use percent-encode