ss — Bing supports RSS output! That's compact XML. Let me try that. Yes, Bing search supports &format=rss.\n\nLet me try: curl -s -G \"https://www.bing.com/search\" --data-urlencode \"q=...\" --data-urlencode \"format=rss\" -A UA | head -c 6000"}
