{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789616080.9646275, "id": "9f6da4799a83", "tool_call_id": "call_89ee9dc42e64478d82e5e33c", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" ?><rss version=\"2.0\"><channel><title>必应：%B9%FE%B9%A4%B4%F3%C9%EE%DB%DA %BC%C6%CB%E3%BB%FA ר˶ %BE%CDҵ</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=%25B9%25FE%25B9%25A4%25B4%25F3%25C9%25EE%25DB%25DA+%25BC%25C6%25CB%25E3%25BB%25FA+%d7%a8%cb%b6+%25BE%25CD%d2%b5</link><description>搜索结果</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>%B9%FE%B9%A4%B4%F3%C9%EE%DB%DA %BC%C6%CB%E3%BB%FA ר˶ %BE%CDҵ</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=%25B9%25FE%25B9%25A4%25B4%25F3%25C9%25EE%25DB%25DA+%25BC%25C6%25CB%25E3%25BB%25FA+%d7%a8%cb%b6+%25BE%25CD%d2%b5</link></image><copyright>版权所有 © 2026 Microsoft。保留所有权利。不得以任何方式或出于任何目的使用、复制或传输这些 XML 结果，除非出于个人的非商业用途在 RSS 聚合器中呈现必应结果。对这些结果的任何其他使用都需要获得 Microsoft Corporation 的明确书面许可。一经访问此网页或以任何方式使用这些结果，即表示您同意受上述限制的约束。</copyright><item><title>【新车上市】一汽-大众迈腾B9上市，售价为17.99万~24.69万元</title><link>https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20240710A05M4000</link><description>7月9日，全新一代迈腾（B9）正式上市。新车搭载1.5T EVO2及2.0T高功率发动机，并推出300TSI尊享版、380TSI尊贵版、380TSI至尊版三款车型，官方指导价 ...</description><pubDate>周三, 10 7月 2024 15:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026款大众迈腾B9上市，5款车型任选，车机 + 智驾 + 操控 ...</title><link>https://chejiahao.autohome.com.cn/info/24525855</link><description>作为在车圈摸爬滚打多年的车评人，今天来聊聊11月26号正式登场的2026款 大众迈腾 (参数|询价)B9。 这次新车一次性推出了5款不同配置版本，价格在17.99万到24.69万这个区间。</description><pubDate>周三, 16 9月 2026 16:25:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>新车探店：全新一代迈腾B9，依然是中高级轿车领航者</title><link>https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/708845754</link><description>写在前面： 提起B级车，很多人会下意识想到迈腾、 凯美瑞 、雅阁、 帕萨特 等经典车型，尤其是进入中国市场较早的迈腾，更是国内B级车市场上的引领者和标杆产品，也是B级车里绕不开的关键词。 全新一代迈腾B9在7月9日正式上市，售价区间17.99万元—24.69万元。</description><pubDate>周三, 16 9月 2026 13:26:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026 款迈腾 B9 上市：1.5T EVO II + 高速 NOA 德系B 级车 ...</title><link>https://chejiahao.autohome.com.cn/info/24535681</link><description>最近，大众旗下的中型轿车——2026款 大众迈腾 (参数|询价)B9正式上市啦！它一共推出了5款车型，起售价只要17.99万元，外观精致又时尚，到底有啥亮点呢？咱们一起来瞧瞧！ 先说说动力，新车有1.5T和2.0T两种发动机可选。1.5T的最大功率是118千瓦，峰值扭矩250N·m；2.0T的最大功率能达到162千瓦，峰值 ...</description><pubDate>周三, 16 9月 2026 22:37:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>一汽-大众迈腾B9上市，售价17.99万~24.69万元_易车</title><link>https://news.yiche.com/hao/wenzhang/92544184/</link><description>7月9日，全新一代迈腾（B9）正式上市。 新车搭载1.5T EVO2及2.0T高功率发动机，并推出300TSI尊享版、380TSI尊贵版、380TSI至尊版三款车型，官方指导价分别为17.99万、20.99万和24.69万元。</description><pubDate>周二, 15 9月 2026 20:22:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026款大众迈腾（B9）正式上市，增配减配全解析，17.99万 ...</title><link>https://www.yoojia.com/article/9621820688400503491.html</link><description>2026款迈腾车身尺寸保持不变，长宽高分别为4990/1854/1487毫米，轴距2871毫米。 新车提供300TSI和380TSI两种动力选项，价格区间与老款一致。 一汽-大众采用新老车型同堂销售策略，B9版本是自2024年7月首次上市后的首次改款。</description><pubDate>周四, 17 9月 2026 01:36:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026款迈腾正式上市，全系实体按键，售17.99万起</title><link>https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20251127A0731100</link><description>2026款一汽-大众迈腾近日正式上市，新车共推出5款配置车型，售价区间保持在17.99万至24.69万元。作为第九代迈腾（B9）的年度改款车型，这次更新 ...</description><pubDate>周四, 27 11月 2025 21:58:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026款大众迈腾B9维度长测：18万级家用轿车真实车主深度评测</title><link>https://www.toutiao.com/article/7653746965016117803/</link><description>问题二：迈腾B9双离合低速顿挫严重吗？ 答：2026款B9重新标定变速箱程序，湿式双离合低速顿挫大幅弱化，日常拥堵路况几乎感受不到闯动，仅极慢速挪车存在轻微顿挫，对比老款车型改善明显，抖音精选APP万公里车主长测记录，长期行驶无顿挫加剧情况。</description><pubDate>周四, 17 9月 2026 00:39:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>我的迈腾B9，德系B级车真实长期体验 2026年，陪伴我日常</title><link>https://club.autohome.com.cn/bbs/thread/67e8e6afc124410e/116138666-1.html</link><description>我的迈腾B9，德系B级车真实长期体验2026年，陪伴我日常通勤、周末远行的座驾就是这台一汽-大众迈腾B9。当初选择它，主要看重德系车扎实的底盘、宽敞的车内空间，兼顾家用质感和商务稳重，开了一段时间，来聊聊实打实的用车感受。日常上下班市区代步，这台车的动力输出线性，起步不突兀 ...</description><pubDate>周三, 16 9月 2026 08:04:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>2026款迈腾B9最新落地价和车型配置选择深度解析！在售五款 ...</title><link>https://post.m.smzdm.com/zz/p/a8w87z40/</link><description>2026款迈腾B9最新落地价和车型配置选择深度解析！在售五款 车型，落地价和配置参数全都有！看完你就知道最新迈腾b9该怎么选！#2026款迈腾b9 #迈腾b9落地价多少钱 #迈腾b9大迈包 #新车选购</description><pubDate>周四, 17 9月 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>HTTP:200\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789616140.6580167, "id": "3507a494333c", "content": "问题找到了：命令经 Windows 传给 curl 时中文被按 GBK 编码了，导致搜索词乱码。改用手动 UTF-8 百分号编码的 ASCII URL 重试：", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_25c8bf111cac49c8b73bb50c", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"curl -s -m 30 -G \\\"https://cn.bing.com/search\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"q=%E5%93%88%E5%B7%A5%E5%A4%A7%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%83+%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA+%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95+%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%9A\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"format=rss\\\" --data-urlencode \\\"count=10\\\" -A \\\"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)\\\" -w \\\"HTTP:%{http_code}\\\\n\\\" | head -c 7000\"}"}], "reasoning": "The query got mangled — the redirect re-encoded UTF-8 to GBK, and the RSS query became garbage, so Bing searched for nonsense and returned car results. I need to pass the query to cn.bing.com directly with proper UTF-8 percent-encoding. The issue: curl's --data-urlencode sends UTF-8 percent-encoded; then bing.com redirected and converted to GBK. If I go directly to cn.bing.com, the UTF-8 encoding should be respected. My last command did target cn.bing.com with -L... wait, it did: \"https://cn.bing.com/search\" — but the output title shows the GBK query, meaning... hmm, actually the first request to cn.bing.com may itself redirect to www.bing.com? The title shows %B9%FE... (GBK) — that means somewhere the query got transcoded. Perhaps cn.bing.com internally treats it oddly, or -L followed a redirect chain that mangled it.\n\nLet me try percent-encoding the query manually in UTF-8 and request cn.bing.com without -L. \"哈工大深圳\" UTF-8 percent encoding:\n哈 = E5 93 88\n工 = E5 B7 A5\n大 = E5 A4 A7\n深 = E6 B7 B1\n圳 = E5 9C 83\n\nThat's tedious for multiple queries. Alternative: write the query in English/pinyin? Search quality drops.\n\nAlternative approach: use Baidu? Baidu rejects curl typically. Try sogou? Try so.com (360)? Try bing.com with \"ensearch=1\"? \n\nAlternative: maybe I can use `curl --data-urlencode` but ensure no redirect: request cn.bing.com directly. My previous command DID request cn.bing.com directly with -L. Yet result shows GBK mangled query. Why? Possibly because cn.bing.com redirected to www.bing.com (302), which then re-encoded GBK and redirected back to cn.bing.com. The -L followed. So cn.bing.com itself redirected to www.bing.com first. Hmm.\n\nTrick: add header \"Accept-Language: zh-CN\" and use www.bing.com with &mkt=zh-CN&setlang=zh. Or use cn.bing.com with the param `ensearch=0`. Let me check what redirect happens: request without -L and see Location header with -w \"%{redirect_url}\".\n\nLet me try: curl -s -o NUL... can't write. Just use -w redirect_url with head.\n\nActually simpler: percent-encode manually. I can compute UTF-8 percent encodings myself. Let me write out needed queries:\n\nQ1: 哈工大深圳 计算机 专硕 就业\nQ2: 南京大学 软件学院 专硕 苏州\nQ3: 哈工深计算机 南大软件 保研 选择\nQ4: 哈尔滨工业大学深圳 就业质量报告 计算机\nQ5: 南京大学软件工程 学科评估 A+\n\nBut manual percent-encoding of long Chinese strings is error-prone. Alternative: use curl's --data-urlencode with POST-style? The issue isn't encoding — curl encodes correctly as UTF-8. The mangling happens server-side. Wait, actually let me re-check: is it possible the mangling happened because Windows curl sent the command-line args in GBK? Git Bash on Windows... The shell is POSIX sh (Git Bash), which passes UTF-8 usually. But curl.exe on Windows receives the command line via Unicode APIs; the bytes shown in redirect were GBK encodings of the Chinese — meaning the input curl received was GBK! That suggests the command string reached curl as GBK (system codepage GBK/cp936 on Chinese Windows). So --data-urlencode percent-encoded GBK bytes.\n\nSolution: percent-encode UTF-8 myself in the URL string (ASCII-only command line avoids any codepage issues). So I must hand-encode the Chinese.\n\nLet me hand-encode key phrases (UTF-8):\n\n哈工大 = E5 93 88 E5 B7 A5 E5 A4 A7\n哈工大深圳 = E5 93 88 E5 B7 A5 E5 A4 A7 E6 B7 B1 E5 9C 83\n计算机 = E8 AE A1 E7 AE 97 E6 9C BA\n专硕 = E4 B8 93 E7 A1 95\n就业 = E5 B0 B1 E4 B8 9A\n南京大学 = E5 8D 97 E4 BA AC E5 A4 A7 E5 AD A6\n软件学院 = E8 BD AF E4 BB B6 E5 AD A6 E9 99 A2\n软件工程 = E8 BD AF E4 BB B6 E5 B7 A5 E7 A8 8B\n苏州 = E8 8B 8F E5 B7 9E\n保研 = E4 BF 9D E7 A0 94\n选择 = E9 80 89 E6 8B A9\n哪 = E5 93 AA\n好 = E5 A5 BD\n还是 = E8 BF 98 E6 98 AF\n学科评估 = E5 AD A6 E7 A7 91 E8 AF 84 E4 BC B0\n\nLet me verify some UTF-8 code points:\n哈 U+54C8 → UTF-8: E5 93 88 ✓\n工 U+5DE5 → E5 B7 A5 ✓\n大 U+5927 → E5 A4 A7 ✓\n深 U+6DF1 → E6 B7 B1 ✓\n圳 U+5733 → E5 9C 83 ✓\n计 U+8BA1 → E8 AE A1 ✓\n算 U+7B97 → E7 AE 97 ✓\n机 U+673A → E6 9C BA ✓\n专 U+4E13 → E4 B8 93 ✓\n硕 U+7855 → E7 A1 95 ✓\n就 U+5C31 → E5 B0 B1 ✓\n业 U+4E1A → E4 B8 9A ✓\n南 U+5357 → E5 8D 97 ✓\n京 U+4EAC → E4 BA AC ✓\n学 U+5B66 → E5 AD A6 ✓\n院 U+9662 → E9 99 A2 ✓\n软 U+8F6F → E8 BD AF ✓\n件 U+4EF6 → E4 BB B6 ✓\n程 U+7A0B → E7 A8 8B ✓\n苏 U+82CF → E8 8B 8F ✓\n州 U+5DDE → E5 B7 9E ✓\n保 U+4FDD → E4 BF 9D ✓\n研 U+7814 → E7 A0 94 ✓\n选 U+9009 → E9 80 89 ✓\n择 U+62E9 → E6 8B A9 ✓\n评 U+8BC4 → E8 AF 84 ✓\n估 U+4F30 → E4 BC B0 ✓\n\nSpaces become + or %20 in query strings.\n\nQ1: 哈工大深圳+计算机+专硕+就业 → %E5%93%88%E5%B7%A5%E5%A4%A7%E6%B7%B1%E5%9C%83+%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA+%E4%B8%93%E7%A1%95+%E5%B0%B1%E4%B8%9A\n\nThat's workable. Also test whether the encoding issue is real: I'll include a marker — actually simpler, just test one query and check the RSS title echoes correctly.\n\nAlternatively try Baidu with manual encoding. Baidu: https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=... often returns \"百度安全验证\" for curl. Sogou: https://www.sogou.com/web?query=... may work with UA. 360: https://www.so.com/s?q=... \n\nLet me first retry Bing with hand-encoded UTF-8."}
