{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789619947.1751192, "id": "928cc564e015", "content": "## 超时修复修复了什么\n\n### 根因：一个浮点数把「读超时」错当「连接超时」用\n\n问题出在 `agent/llm/llm_clients/openai_client.py:31`（修复前）：\n\n```python\nhttpx2.Client(proxy=proxy, trust_env=False, timeout=self.request_timeout)  # 60.0\n```\n\n`timeout=60` 是单一浮点数，httpx 会把它**同时**套在 connect / read / write / pool 四个阶段上。关键在 **read 超时的语义：它是「两个数据块之间的最大间隔」，不是总时长**。所以流式响应只要 **60 秒内一个字节都没吐**，就抛 `ReadTimeout` → 界面上的 \"Request timed out.\"，然后重试 3 次、每次再等 60 秒、再死同一个坑。\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"API 60s 没吐字节\"] --> B{\"旧代码 read=60s\"}\n    B --> C[\"ReadTimeout\"]\n    C --> D[\"重试 1/3, 2/3, 3/3\"]\n    D --> E[\"每次再等 60s 再超时\"]\n    E --> F[\"Request timed out.\"]\n```\n\n而「网络环境良好」完全不矛盾——因为触发它的三个场景都是**长流式连接独有**的，浏览网页、搜索这些短请求根本测不出来：\n\n| 场景 | 表现 |\n|---|---|\n| 供应商过载停顿（DeepSeek 等高峰期） | 连上了但迟迟不吐 token |\n| 中转站 / API relay 缓存整段回复、最后才 flush | **长回复必超时**，短回复正常 |\n| 长连接被链路限流降速 | 短请求秒回，长流被掐 |\n\n### 修复内容（4 处，测试已全绿）\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|---|---|\n| `agent/config.py` | 新增 `llm_read_timeout: 240.0`（流式读预算，独立于请求超时） |\n| `agent/llm/llm_clients/openai_client.py` | `Timeout(60, connect=15, read=240)`：**连接 15s 快速失败**（死路由不再干等 60s），**读停顿容忍 240s** |\n| `agent/llm/client.py` | 超时错误按阶段报：`Connect timed out`（路由/代理/base_url 问题）vs `Read timed out`（供应商停顿/中转缓存），错误自己解释自己 |\n| `agent/llm/factory.py` + `agent/base.py` | 把新参数接进构建链 |\n\n`tests/llm_client_test.py` 补了 4 项断言（阶段化消息 + 预算拆分），25 项全过。\n\n### 为什么你「又超时了」\n\n**修复在磁盘上，但你正在用的会话进程还是旧代码。** Python 进程启动时加载的模块不会热更新——需要重启后端才生效：关掉所有 Clutch 窗口（supervisor 随之退出）再重新 `npm start`，或在会话里重启该对话的后端。\n\n生效后的行为变化：\n\n- 连不上 API：15 秒内报 `Connect timed out`，快速失败快速重试，不再干等 60s；\n- 流式停顿：240 秒内的间隔直接熬过去（大概率就是这 4 分钟里恢复的停顿），不再动辄报错；\n- 停顿超过 240s 仍会超时，但消息会明说「API 长时间没发数据（供应商停顿或中转缓存）」——如果重启后还频繁见到这条，那下一步该查的就是你填的 base_url 是不是走了会缓存流式响应的中转站，换成官方端点或直连即可。\n\n另外记得：手头的 websearch 功能还差 `agent/tools/websearch.py` 本体没写完（配置项和注册点已就绪），要继续的话说一声。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "The user is asking again: \"又超时了。你先告诉我超时修复修复了什么？\" (It timed out again. First tell me: what did the timeout fix fix?)\n\nThis is a direct question. I should answer clearly what the timeout fix does, before continuing with the websearch feature. The user's UI keeps timing out (\"又超时了\" — it timed out again). I should:\n\n1. Explain what the root cause diagnosis found.\n2. Explain what the fix changed (4 files + tests, all passing).\n3. Explain what \"timed out again\" means now — important: the fix changed behavior, but note that the timeout they may still be seeing could be (a) a pre-fix session still running with old code (the running session uses the old code until restarted!), or (b) a read stall >240s, or (c) UI-side apiFetch 30s timeout to the local server, or (d) actually the current Clutch session they're using to talk to me hasn't been restarted so old 60s code is live.\n\nKey point: my fix edits the source on disk, but the running agent session (this very conversation's backend) was started before the fix — the timeout budget change only takes effect when the backend restarts. That's likely why \"又超时了\" — they're still on the old process. I must tell them to restart the session/backend (close windows/restart the app, or the supervisor session) to pick up the new code.\n\nAlso note: the read budget is now 240s; if the provider stalls longer than that, it still times out — but with a self-explanatory message now (\"Read timed out: the API sent no data for a long stretch...\").\n\nLet me summarize clearly with a table: before vs after. And the mechanism diagram maybe. Keep it focused — answer the question first, then mention the pending websearch work status briefly and next steps (restart backend; I still owe them websearch.py implementation + tests).\n\nAlso: they asked \"你先告诉我\" — tell me FIRST. So the reply should lead with the explanation, no tool calls needed... Should I do any tool calls? Maybe not necessary — I have all the info. The instruction says reply with final explanation and NO tool calls when done. But the websearch feature is half-finished (config edited, module not written yet). The user's question takes priority; I can answer and note the remaining work. I could also offer to continue. Since they explicitly asked \"先告诉我\" (first tell me), answering without tool calls is right.\n\nLet me write the answer in Chinese, well-structured:\n\n## 超时修复修复了什么\n\n**症状**: 网络良好，但 LLM 请求频繁 \"Request timed out.\"\n\n**根因** (located in agent/llm/llm_clients/openai_client.py):\n- 旧代码: `httpx2.Client(timeout=60)` 一个浮点数 → connect/read/write/pool 全是 60s\n- httpx 的 read 超时是「两个数据块之间的间隔上限」，不是总时长\n- 流式响应里只要 API 60 秒不吐任何字节就抛 ReadTimeout:\n  - 供应商过载停顿（DeepSeek 等高峰期常见）\n  - 中转站/relay 把整段回复缓存到最后才 flush → 长回复必超时\n  - 长连接被链路限流/降速（浏览等短请求测网络正常，长流式连接才受影响——所以\"网络良好\"）\n- 之后重试 3 次 × 60s，每次都死在同一个坑 → 频繁超时\n\n**修复** (4 files):\n1. `agent/config.py`: 新增 `llm_read_timeout: 240.0`\n2. `agent/llm/llm_clients/openai_client.py`: 拆分预算 `Timeout(60, connect=15, read=240)`\n3. `agent/llm/client.py`: 超时消息分阶段（connect/pool/read），错误自己解释自己\n4. `agent/llm/factory.py` + `agent/base.py`: 传递新参数\n\nBefore/after table.\n\n**为什么\"又超时了\"**: \n- 修复已落盘且测试全过，但**正在运行的会话进程还是旧代码**——必须重启后端（关掉所有窗口让 supervisor 退出，重新 `npm start`，或重启会话）才生效。\n- 生效后：连接失败 15s 快速报错；流式停顿可容忍 240s；停顿超过 240s 仍会超时，但错误信息会明说是哪一段、什么原因。\n- 如果重启后还是频繁超时，下一个怀疑对象就是 UI → 本地服务器的 apiFetch 30s 或反代/隧道，那是另一条路径。\n\n**待办**: websearch 模块还没写完（config 和注册点已就绪）。\n\nI should present this concisely with a mermaid or table. Let me write it."}
