ried didn't start with http. Looking at the test code, it probably extracts the first `https?://\\S+` from the output — that should work. Unless... it parses `r['url']` from a regex capturing the numbered list — line \"1. title\\n   https://www.hitsz.edu.cn/\". Regex might be capturing wrong.\n\nLet me read the live test section."}
