{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789625766.498516, "id": "0f2ab626596c", "tool_call_id": "call_fa9d7fb34c724de0948b0c64", "content": "140:     )\n141: \n142:     # web access: read-only network tools in BOTH modes — chat's read-only\n143:     # contract is about the workspace; a GET touches nothing local\n144:     tools.append(\n145:         Tool(\n146:             name=\"web_search\",\n147:             description=render(\"tools/web_search.md\", max_results=config.web_search_max_results),\n148:             parameters={\n149:                 \"properties\": {\n150:                     \"query\": _str_param(\"search string (engine syntax like site: and quoted phrases works)\"),\n151:                     \"max_results\": {\n152:                         \"type\": \"integer\",\n153:                         \"description\": f\"cap on returned entries (default {config.web_search_max_results})\",\n154:                     },\n155:                     \"backend\": _str_param(\n156:                         \"pin one backend: tavily | searxng | bing | ddg (default: fall through the chain)\"\n157:                     ),\n158:                 },\n159:                 \"required\": [\"query\"],\n160:             },\n161:             func=lambda sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw: websearch.web_search(sb, cfg, cancel=cancel, **kw),\n162:         )\n163:     )\n164:     tools.append(\n165:         Tool(\n166:             name=\"web_fetch\",\n167:             description=render(\"tools/web_fetch.md\", max=config.read_max_chars),\n168:             parameters={\n169:                 \"properties\": {\n170:                     \"url\": _str_param(\"http(s) URL to fetch\"),\n171:                     \"max_chars\": {\n172:                         \"type\": \"integer\",\n173:                         \"description\": f\"max chars of extracted text to return (default {config.read_max_chars})\",\n174:                     },\n175:                     \"start\": {\n176:                         \"type\": \"integer\",\n177:                         \"description\": \"0-based char offset to continue a truncated fetch\",\n178:                     },\n179:                 },\n180:                 \"required\": [\"url\"],\n181:             },\n182:             func=lambda sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw: websearch.web_fetch(sb, cfg, cancel=cancel, **kw),\n183:         )\n184:     )\n185: \n186:     if config.enable_skills:\n187:         skill_tool = _build_load_skill(config)\n188:         if skill_tool is not None:\n189:             tools.append(skill_tool)\n190:     if memories is not None:\n191:         tools.extend(_build_memory_tools(memories))\n192:     return tools\n193: \n194: \n... (showing lines 140-194 of 372; use offset=195 to continue)", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789625766.5000942, "id": "8a2cea7738b4", "tool_call_id": "call_c830fe63b4ed42028c0a23d0", "content": "Search the web for information the workspace cannot answer: current events, library versions and release notes, error messages, docs pages. Returns ranked results (title, URL, snippet); follow up with web_fetch on the 1-2 most relevant URLs for the full text. query is the search string — engine syntax like quoted phrases, site: and -term filters work; short factual queries beat long sentences. max_results caps entries (default $max). Backends try in order: tavily (needs CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY), searxng (needs CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL), bing, duckduckgo — the first that returns results wins; when all fail the error lists each backend's reason, and backend=<name> pins one.\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789625846.0711534, "id": "6c987d16c61d", "content": "集成已经全部完成并验证通过。整个工作分七步，我按数据流从头讲到尾：\n\n## 一、先做的决策：自己写，纯标准库\n\n调研了 GitHub 上的现成方案——`deedy5/ddgs`(2973★)、`tavily-python`(1399★)、SearXNG、MCP servers(90k★)。结论是都不直接采用：\n\n- 要么引入新依赖(违背本项目零依赖的取向)，要么锁死单一后端；\n- 本机网络现实是 **DDG 不可达、Bing RSS 免 key 可用**——单一后端在这个网络环境下必挂。\n\n所以最终形态：**自研一个 525 行的模块，纯 stdlib**(`urllib` + `html.parser` + `ElementTree`),零新依赖，但**后端可插拔**——网络环境变了换链就行。\n\n## 二、模块分层:`agent/tools/websearch.py`\n\n| 层 | 组件 | 关键设计 |\n|---|---|---|\n| HTTP 核心 | `_http_get` / `_drain` / `HttpResp` | 15s 超时、gzip 解压、**2MB 硬上限**、按 64KB 分块读且**每块之间检查 cancel**——Stop 立即生效，不用等请求结束 |\n| SSRF 防护 | `_assert_public_host` / `_SafeRedirects` | 先 `getaddrinfo` 解析、再逐 IP 检查 `is_global`,拒绝 loopback/LAN/`.localhost/.local/.internal`;**重定向每一跳都复查** |\n| HTML→文本 | `_TextExtractor` / `_clean_snippet` / `_window` | 丢 script/style/nav/footer,块级标签转换行，实体解码，`start=N` 分窗续读 |\n| 四个后端 | `_tavily` `_searxng` `_bing` `_ddg` | 签名统一，都返回 `[{title, url, snippet}]` |\n| 入口 | `web_search` / `web_fetch` | 链式回退、URL 去重、错误即数据 |\n\n两个值得注意的异常设计：\n\n```python\nclass WebError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"A request-level failure (DNS, timeout, size cap, private host).\"\"\"\n\nclass BackendError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"A backend responded but yielded nothing usable (blocked, layout changed).\"\"\"\n```\n\n分开的原因：前者直接上抛给入口，后者**触发链式回退**——Bing 被反爬挡了(有响应但没结果)就自动落到 DDG,而不是把失败抛给用户。所有环节都遵循项目「错误即数据」原则：失败变成带原因的 ERROR 文本喂回模型，让它自己读错、换参数重试。\n\n## 三、配置接线:`agent/config.py`\n\n```python\nweb_search_timeout: float = 15.0\nweb_search_max_results: int = 8\ntavily_api_key: ...   # env CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY 或 TAVILY_API_KEY\nsearxng_url: ...      # env CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL 或 SEARXNG_URL\n```\n\n没配 key/url 时 tavily/searxng 自动不进链，**默认开箱即用走 Bing**。截断默认值直接复用已有的 `read_max_chars`(20000),不另造配置。\n\n## 四、注册进工具表:`agent/tools/registry.py`\n\n```python\n# web access: read-only network tools in BOTH modes — chat's read-only\n# contract is about the workspace; a GET touches nothing local\ntools.append(Tool(\n    name=\"web_search\",\n    description=render(\"tools/web_search.md\", max_results=config.web_search_max_results),\n    parameters={...},\n    func=lambda sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw: websearch.web_search(sb, cfg, cancel=cancel, **kw),\n))\n```\n\n三个要点：\n\n1. **work/chat 两模式都注册**——chat 模式的只读契约针对的是工作区，一个 GET 不碰本地任何东西，注释里把这条边界写明了；\n2. lambda 统一签名 `(sandbox, config, cancel=None, **kw)`,把 agent 循环的 cancel 事件**穿透到 `_drain` 的块间检查**；\n3. `parameters` schema 是给模型看的接口文档，`backend` 参数还允许模型手动钉死某个后端(调试用)。\n\n## 五、提示词:`agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md`\n\n不写死数字，用 `render()` 把配置值注入(`default $max`),配置改了文案自动跟上。内容教的是**使用策略**而不是参数罗列：短查询优于长句、`site:` 和引号语法可用、先 search 再对最相关的 1–2 条 fetch 全文。\n\n## 六、测试:`tests/websearch_test.py`\n\n31 项离线检查，全部通过 monkeypatch `ws._http_get` 用**罐头响应**驱动，完全不联网：\n\n- 解析正确性(Bing RSS 的 XML、DDG 的重定向 `uddg` 参数解码、Tavily/SearXNG 的 JSON)\n- 回退链(bing 403 → 自动落到 ddg)、钉死后端时报告自己的失败\n- SSRF 拒绝清单(localhost/127.0.0.1/192.168.x/ftp)与公网 IP 放行\n- registry 接线(两模式都在、chat 仍隐藏写工具)\n\n`--live` 开关走真实网络，验证了 Bing 搜索 + `hitsz.edu.cn` 全文抓取。\n\n## 七、README 同步\n\n工具清单、环境变量说明、测试入口都补了。\n\n---\n\n整条链路长这样：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    M[\"模型 tool call: web_search(query)\"] --> REG[\"registry.Tool<br/>参数 schema + cancel 事件\"]\n    REG --> WS[\"websearch.web_search\"]\n    WS --> CH{\"后端链 首个成功者胜\"}\n    CH -->|\"1 tavily 需 key\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"2 searxng 需 URL\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"3 bing 免 key\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"4 ddg 兜底\"| GET\n    GET[\"_http_get<br/>15s 超时 / 2MB 上限 / gzip / SSRF 逐跳检查\"]\n    GET --> OUT[\"统一结果 title/url/snippet<br/>去重 + error-as-data\"]\n    OUT --> R2[\"结果回对话<br/>模型决定是否 web_fetch 深读\"]\n```\n\n`web_fetch` 复用同一个 `_http_get`,只是出口换成 `_TextExtractor` + `_window`(截断时提示 `start=N` 续读)。\n\n至于调试过程中踩的坑(实体解码、live 测试取错行、GBK 控制台假乱码)，上一条已经讲过——都是测试壳的问题，模块本体一次写就后没改过架构。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "I have everything I need. Now let me also quickly recall the config lines (already seen: lines 72-81) and web_fetch.md prompt — I have enough to describe it. Let me write the integration story.\n\nStructure of the answer — the user wants to know \"how the websearch tool was integrated\". This is a walkthrough of the integration architecture and steps:\n\n1. 调研决策 (why self-designed, stdlib-only)\n2. 核心模块 agent/tools/websearch.py 的分层架构:\n   - HTTP core: _http_get (UA, gzip, 2MB cap, cancel between chunks), HttpResp\n   - SSRF guard: _assert_public_host + _SafeRedirects\n   - HTML→text: _TextExtractor, _clean_snippet, _window\n   - 4 backends: _tavily/_searxng/_bing/_ddg + chain\n   - entries: web_search / web_fetch (error-as-data)\n3. 配置接线 agent/config.py\n4. 注册 agent/tools/registry.py (both modes, lambda signatures, cancellation passthrough)\n5. 提示词 agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md (render with config values)\n6. 测试 tests/websearch_test.py (offline fixtures + --live)\n7. 文档 README\n\nMaybe a mermaid diagram of the architecture/chain. Mermaid rules: no nested double quotes in labels, subgraph with quoted titles.\n\nA flowchart showing:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    M[模型 tool call] --> R[registry.Tool]\n    R --> W[\"websearch.web_search / web_fetch\"]\n    W --> C{\"backend chain\"}\n    C --> T[\"tavily (key?)\"]\n    C --> S[\"searxng (url?)\"]\n    C --> B[\"bing RSS\"]\n    C --> D[\"ddg HTML\"]\n    T & S & B & D --> G[\"_http_get\"]\n    G --> P[\"_assert_public_host\"]\n    ...\n```\n\nCareful with mermaid: parentheses inside quoted labels are OK; avoid nested double quotes. Use single labels without quotes where possible. Actually `[...]` labels with parentheses inside quotes are fine. The rule: never nest a double quote inside a node/edge label. I'll use quoted labels with no internal double quotes.\n\nLet me design the diagram:\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    M[\"模型发起 tool call<br/>web_search(query)\"] --> REG[\"registry: Tool 参数 schema + cancel\"]\n    REG --> WS[\"websearch.web_search\"]\n    WS --> CH{\"后端链: 首个成功者胜\"}\n    CH -->|1| TV[\"tavily JSON API<br/>需 CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY\"]\n    CH -->|2| SX[\"SearXNG JSON<br/>需 CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL\"]\n    CH -->|3| BG[\"Bing RSS<br/>format=rss 免 key\"]\n    CH -->|4| DG[\"DuckDuckGo HTML<br/>HTMLParser 解析\"]\n    TV --> GET[\"_http_get: 15s 超时 + 2MB 上限 + gzip + UA\"]\n    SX --> GET\n    BG --> GET\n    DG --> GET\n    GET --> SSRF[\"_assert_public_host: is_global + 拒内网域名\"]\n    GET --> RES[\"结果列表 title/url/snippet\"]\n    RES --> OUT[\"去重 + 截断提示 + error-as-data\"]\n```\n\nHmm, GET --> SSRF order is odd (SSRF happens before request). Reorder: GET calls _assert_public_host first. Simpler: make _assert_public_host a note inside GET. Keep the diagram simpler — less is more. Maybe skip the SSRF node and fold into GET label.\n\nAlso a sequence for web_fetch? One diagram is probably enough, plus tables.\n\nStructure:\n\n## 一、决策:自己写,纯标准库\n- 调研了 deedy5/ddgs (2973★), tavily-python (1399★), searxng, MCP servers——都能用,但要么引依赖、要么锁死单一后端\n- 本机网络现实:DDG 不可达,Bing RSS 免 key 可用 → 后端链设计\n- 纯 stdlib (urllib + html.parser + ElementTree), 零新依赖\n\n## 二、模块分层 (websearch.py, 525 行)\nTable of layers with line refs.\n\n| 层 | 组件 | 职责 |\n|---|---|---|\n| HTTP 核心 | `_http_get` / `_drain` / `HttpResp` | 15s 超时、gzip 解压、2MB 硬上限、分块读取间响应 Stop |\n| SSRF 防护 | `_assert_public_host` / `_SafeRedirects` | 解析 DNS 后逐 IP 检查 `is_global`,拒绝 localhost/.local/.internal;重定向逐跳复查 |\n| HTML→文本 | `_TextExtractor` / `_clean_snippet` / `_window` | 去 script/style/nav/footer、块级换行、实体解码、start=N 续读窗口 |\n| 后端 | `_tavily` `_searxng` `_bing` `_ddg` | 统一返回 [{title,url,snippet}] |\n| 入口 | `web_search` / `web_fetch` | 链式回退、去重、错误即数据 |\n\nKey design decisions to highlight:\n- WebError vs BackendError 分开: \"backend responded but yielded nothing usable\" drives链式回退\n- error-as-data: 所有失败变成 ERROR 文本喂回模型\n- cancel: _drain 在 64KB 块之间检查 cancel event → Stop 立即生效,不等到请求结束\n- browser-shaped UA: \"several CDNs 403 blank UAs\"\n\n## 三、配置接线 (config.py)\n- web_search_timeout: 15.0\n- web_search_max_results: 8\n- tavily_api_key: env CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY or TAVILY_API_KEY\n- searxng_url: env CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL or SEARXNG_URL\n- 特点: 复用已有 read_max_chars 做截断默认\n\n## 四、注册进 registry.py\n- show the actual wiring code snippet\n- work/chat 两模式都注册;注释解释为什么 chat 也能用 (read-only contract is about workspace; GET touches nothing local)\n- lambda 统一签名 (sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw): cancel 从 agent 循环穿透到 _drain\n- parameters schema 描述给模型\n\n## 五、提示词 (prompts/tools/web_search.md)\n- render() 把配置值注入文案 (default $max)\n- 指导模型怎么用: 短查询、engine syntax、先 search 再 fetch 1-2 条\n\n## 六、测试 (tests/websearch_test.py)\n- 31 项离线: 全部用 fake _http_get 的 canned fixtures (BING_RSS/ DDG_HTML/ TAVILY_JSON/ SEARXNG_JSON), 不联网\n- monkeypatch ws._http_get\n- --live 实网验证\n- SSRF 拒绝清单测试\n\n## 七、文档 README\n\nMaybe end with mermaid of the whole data flow. And a \"调试中踩的坑\" quick recap linking to previous answer (snippet entities, live test URL extraction, GBK console).\n\nActually I already told the debugging story in the first turn of this conversation. I can reference briefly.\n\nLet me build the mermaid flow carefully. Rules: quoted labels, no nested double quotes. `<br/>` works in mermaid 10. Use `-->|label|` edge labels.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    M[\"模型 tool call: web_search(query)\"] --> REG[\"registry.Tool<br/>参数 schema + cancel 事件\"]\n    REG --> WS[\"websearch.web_search\"]\n    WS --> CH{\"后端链 首个成功者胜\"}\n    CH -->|\"1 tavily 需 key\"| TV[\"JSON API\"]\n    CH -->|\"2 searxng 需 URL\"| SX[\"JSON API\"]\n    CH -->|\"3 bing 免 key\"| BG[\"RSS + ElementTree\"]\n    CH -->|\"4 ddg 兜底\"| DG[\"HTML + HTMLParser\"]\n    TV --> GET[\"_http_get<br/>15s 超时 / 2MB 上限 / gzip / SSRF 检查\"]\n    SX --> GET\n    BG --> GET\n    DG --> GET\n    GET --> OUT[\"统一结果 title/url/snippet<br/>去重 + error-as-data\"]\n    OUT --> FB[\"失败文本喂回模型<br/>模型读错自己重试\"]\n```\n\nHmm FB after OUT is confusing. Simpler ending: OUT --> M? Back to model. Let me do:\n\nOUT --> R2[\"tool result 回到对话<br/>模型决定是否 web_fetch\"]\n\nThat's nice — shows the loop with web_fetch. Add note that web_fetch shares the same _http_get.\n\nKeep it to one diagram. Numbers on edges as \"1|tavily...\" with a space might parse fine; `|\"1 tavily 需 key\"|` quoted edge label is fine.\n\nNow write the final answer in Chinese. Length: this deserves a thorough but organized answer. Use tables, code snippets (short), one mermaid."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1789625846.0743687, "id": "650113ebf870", "status": "completed", "summary": "集成已经全部完成并验证通过。整个工作分七步，我按数据流从头讲到尾：\n\n## 一、先做的决策：自己写，纯标准库\n\n调研了 GitHub 上的现成方案——`deedy5/ddgs`(2973★)、`tavily-python`(1399★)、SearXNG、MCP servers(90k★)。结论是都不直接采用：\n\n- 要么引入新依赖(违背本项目零依赖的取向)，要么锁死单一后端；\n- 本机网络现实是 **DDG 不可达、Bing RSS 免 key 可用**——单一后端在这个网络环境下必挂。\n\n所以最终形态：**自研一个 525 行的模块，纯 stdlib**(`urllib` + `html.parser` + `ElementTree`),零新依赖，但**后端可插拔**——网络环境变了换链就行。\n\n## 二、模块分层:`agent/tools/websearch.py`\n\n| 层 | 组件 | 关键设计 |\n|---|---|---|\n| HTTP 核心 | `_http_get` / `_drain` / `HttpResp` | 15s 超时、gzip 解压、**2MB 硬上限**、按 64KB 分块读且**每块之间检查 cancel**——Stop 立即生效，不用等请求结束 |\n| SSRF 防护 | `_assert_public_host` / `_SafeRedirects` | 先 `getaddrinfo` 解析、再逐 IP 检查 `is_global`,拒绝 loopback/LAN/`.localhost/.local/.internal`;**重定向每一跳都复查** |\n| HTML→文本 | `_TextExtractor` / `_clean_snippet` / `_window` | 丢 script/style/nav/footer,块级标签转换行，实体解码，`start=N` 分窗续读 |\n| 四个后端 | `_tavily` `_searxng` `_bing` `_ddg` | 签名统一，都返回 `[{title, url, snippet}]` |\n| 入口 | `web_search` / `web_fetch` | 链式回退、URL 去重、错误即数据 |\n\n两个值得注意的异常设计：\n\n```python\nclass WebError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"A request-level failure (DNS, timeout, size cap, private host).\"\"\"\n\nclass BackendError(Exception):\n    \"\"\"A backend responded but yielded nothing usable (blocked, layout changed).\"\"\"\n```\n\n分开的原因：前者直接上抛给入口，后者**触发链式回退**——Bing 被反爬挡了(有响应但没结果)就自动落到 DDG,而不是把失败抛给用户。所有环节都遵循项目「错误即数据」原则：失败变成带原因的 ERROR 文本喂回模型，让它自己读错、换参数重试。\n\n## 三、配置接线:`agent/config.py`\n\n```python\nweb_search_timeout: float = 15.0\nweb_search_max_results: int = 8\ntavily_api_key: ...   # env CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY 或 TAVILY_API_KEY\nsearxng_url: ...      # env CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL 或 SEARXNG_URL\n```\n\n没配 key/url 时 tavily/searxng 自动不进链，**默认开箱即用走 Bing**。截断默认值直接复用已有的 `read_max_chars`(20000),不另造配置。\n\n## 四、注册进工具表:`agent/tools/registry.py`\n\n```python\n# web access: read-only network tools in BOTH modes — chat's read-only\n# contract is about the workspace; a GET touches nothing local\ntools.append(Tool(\n    name=\"web_search\",\n    description=render(\"tools/web_search.md\", max_results=config.web_search_max_results),\n    parameters={...},\n    func=lambda sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw: websearch.web_search(sb, cfg, cancel=cancel, **kw),\n))\n```\n\n三个要点：\n\n1. **work/chat 两模式都注册**——chat 模式的只读契约针对的是工作区，一个 GET 不碰本地任何东西，注释里把这条边界写明了；\n2. lambda 统一签名 `(sandbox, config, cancel=None, **kw)`,把 agent 循环的 cancel 事件**穿透到 `_drain` 的块间检查**；\n3. `parameters` schema 是给模型看的接口文档，`backend` 参数还允许模型手动钉死某个后端(调试用)。\n\n## 五、提示词:`agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md`\n\n不写死数字，用 `render()` 把配置值注入(`default $max`),配置改了文案自动跟上。内容教的是**使用策略**而不是参数罗列：短查询优于长句、`site:` 和引号语法可用、先 search 再对最相关的 1–2 条 fetch 全文。\n\n## 六、测试:`tests/websearch_test.py`\n\n31 项离线检查，全部通过 monkeypatch `ws._http_get` 用**罐头响应**驱动，完全不联网：\n\n- 解析正确性(Bing RSS 的 XML、DDG 的重定向 `uddg` 参数解码、Tavily/SearXNG 的 JSON)\n- 回退链(bing 403 → 自动落到 ddg)、钉死后端时报告自己的失败\n- SSRF 拒绝清单(localhost/127.0.0.1/192.168.x/ftp)与公网 IP 放行\n- registry 接线(两模式都在、chat 仍隐藏写工具)\n\n`--live` 开关走真实网络，验证了 Bing 搜索 + `hitsz.edu.cn` 全文抓取。\n\n## 七、README 同步\n\n工具清单、环境变量说明、测试入口都补了。\n\n---\n\n整条链路长这样：\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    M[\"模型 tool call: web_search(query)\"] --> REG[\"registry.Tool<br/>参数 schema + cancel 事件\"]\n    REG --> WS[\"websearch.web_search\"]\n    WS --> CH{\"后端链 首个成功者胜\"}\n    CH -->|\"1 tavily 需 key\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"2 searxng 需 URL\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"3 bing 免 key\"| GET\n    CH -->|\"4 ddg 兜底\"| GET\n    GET[\"_http_get<br/>15s 超时 / 2MB 上限 / gzip / SSRF 逐跳检查\"]\n    GET --> OUT[\"统一结果 title/url/snippet<br/>去重 + error-as-data\"]\n    OUT --> R2[\"结果回对话<br/>模型决定是否 web_fetch 深读\"]\n```\n\n`web_fetch` 复用同一个 `_http_get`,只是出口换成 `_TextExtractor` + `_window`(截断时提示 `start=N` 续读)。\n\n至于调试过程中踩的坑(实体解码、live 测试取错行、GBK 控制台假乱码)，上一条已经讲过——都是测试壳的问题，模块本体一次写就后没改过架构。"}
