{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789629491.390459, "id": "15bc22c3835d", "content": "两个旗舰都确认了(MediaCrawler 65k★、Agent-Reach 82.6k★,均在活跃维护)。现在看两个最贴合 agent 场景的项目**怎么解决登录/签名**:", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_9294b4d610eb46e9b663b35d", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"curl -s -H \\\"Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json\\\" \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/Panniantong/Agent-Reach/readme\\\" | head -100\"}"}, {"id": "call_f86d50438e9e4ee595d8db5e", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"curl -s -H \\\"Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json\\\" \\\"https://api.github.com/repos/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp/readme\\\" | head -90\"}"}], "reasoning": "MediaCrawler confirmed: 65.1k★, pushed 2026-09-15 (actively maintained). Now the two most agent-relevant projects — Agent-Reach (82.6k★) and xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp (15.8k★). Read their READMEs to understand HOW they access XHS (login approach: playwright + cookies? signing?), which determines what Clutch can borrow.\n\nFetch READMEs raw:\n- https://api.github.com/repos/Panniantong/Agent-Reach/readme with Accept: application/vnd.github.raw+json | head -120\n- https://api.github.com/repos/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp/readme same | head -120\n\nPipe through head; README may be Chinese — output to terminal might GBK-mangle but readable enough? Earlier established: console mangles CJK. curl output piped to head: bytes shown raw — Git Bash pipe carries UTF-8 bytes, the harness decodes UTF-8 → should be fine actually (curl | head of a UTF-8 page earlier? The bing RSS probe via curl earlier in project showed garbled because of curl -o file? Not sure). The mangling earlier was Python's GBK stdout; curl pipes raw bytes → harness reads UTF-8 → fine. Chinese in curl|head output should display correctly."}
