{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789629528.0237405, "id": "8549ee859d2b", "tool_call_id": "call_bbcb741c7dba48f8b8a4046f", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n> **不知道怎么配？不用查文档。** 直接告诉 Agent「帮我配 XXX」，它知道需要什么、会一步一步引导你。\n>\n> 🍪 Twitter 只接受用户通过 Cookie-Editor 手工导出的内容。Agent Reach 不替用户执行小红书登录，也不读取小红书浏览器 Cookie；OpenCLI 只使用用户已经存在且明确控制的 Chrome 会话。`agent-reach configure xhs-cookies` 不会把 Cookie 注入 OpenCLI / Chrome；没有现成会话时，改用 Cookie-Editor 导出后配置 xiaohongshu-mcp / 存量工具。\n>\n> Twitter Cookie 保存后仅供 `agent-reach doctor` 检查配置是否齐全；直接运行上游 `twitter` 命令前，仍需在当前进程环境中显式设置 `TWITTER_AUTH_TOKEN` 和 `TWITTER_CT0`。\n>\n> 🔒 Cookie 只存在你本地，不上传不外传。代码完全开源，随时可审查。\n> 💻 本地电脑不需要代理。代理只有部署在服务器上才需要（~$1/月）。\n\n--\n├── facebook.py     → OpenCLI（桌面浏览器登录态）\n├── instagram.py    → OpenCLI（桌面浏览器登录态）\n├── xiaohongshu.py  → OpenCLI ▸ xiaohongshu-mcp ▸ xhs-cli\n├── linkedin.py     → mcp-server-linkedin ▸ Jina Reader\n├── rss.py          → feedparser\n├── exa_search.py   → Exa via mcporter\n└── __init__.py     → 渠道注册（doctor 检测用）\n```\n\n--\n| GitHub | [gh CLI](https://cli.github.com) | — | 官方工具，认证后完整 API 能力 |\n| 读 RSS | [feedparser](https://github.com/kurtmckee/feedparser) | — | Python 生态标准选择 |\n| 小红书 | [OpenCLI](https://github.com/jackwener/opencli)（桌面） | [xiaohongshu-mcp](https://github.com/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp)（服务器）▸ xhs-cli | OpenCLI 只用用户已有会话；其余后端用 Cookie-Editor 手工导出 |\n| LinkedIn | [mcp-server-linkedin](https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server) | Jina Reader | MCP 服务，浏览器自动化 |\n\n> 📌 这些都是「当前选型」，基于真机实测定期复核。某条路失效了我们换下一条——`agent-reach doctor` 永远告诉你现在走的是哪条。\n\n---\n\n--\n## 致谢\n\n[OpenCLI](https://github.com/jackwener/opencli) · [twitter-cli](https://github.com/public-clis/twitter-cli) · [rdt-cli](https://github.com/public-clis/rdt-cli) · [xiaohongshu-mcp](https://github.com/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp) · [xhs-cli](https://github.com/jackwener/xiaohongshu-cli) · [bili-cli](https://github.com/public-clis/bilibili-cli) · [yt-dlp](https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp) · [Jina Reader](https://github.com/jina-ai/reader) · [Exa](https://exa.ai) · [mcporter](https://github.com/nicobailon/mcporter) · [feedparser](https://github.com/kurtmckee/feedparser) · [mcp-server-linkedin](https://github.com/stickerdaniel/linkedin-mcp-server)\n\n## 联系\n\n- 📧 **Email:** pnt01@foxmail.com\n- 🐦 **Twitter/X:** [@Neo_Reidlab](https://x.com/Neo_Reidlab)\n\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789629530.1405365, "id": "4d04edefdd98", "tool_call_id": "call_db15a58c711f4096bad0fb0c", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n\n1. 该项目是在自己的另外一个项目的基础上开源出来的，原来的项目稳定运行一年多，没有出现过封号的情况，只有出现过 Cookies 过期需要重新登录。\n2. 我是使用 Claude Code 接入，稳定自动化运营数周后，验证没有问题后开源。\n3. 如果账号没有实名认证，特别是新号，一般会触发 **实名认证** 的消息提醒（参见下图）。⚠️ 这个不是封号，不用 MCP 也会要求实名认证。实名认证后，账号就正常了。建议使用该项目前就先实名。\n   <img width=\"508\" height=\"306\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34383e1b-f666-409f-9870-002655507dc1\" />\n--\n- 配置内置浏览器和中文字体\n- 挂载 `./data` 用于存储 cookies 和运行数据目录\n- 挂载 `./images` 用于存储发布的图片\n- 暴露 18060 端口供 MCP 连接\n\n--\n# 非无头模式，有浏览器界面\n./xiaohongshu-mcp-darwin-arm64 -headless=false\n```\n\n**使用源码**：\n--\n# 非无头模式，有浏览器界面\ngo run . -headless=false\n```\n\n**配置代理（可选）**：\n--\n# 或者有界面模式\ngo run . -headless=false\n```\n\n服务将运行在：`http://localhost:18060/mcp`\n--\n- `get_login_qrcode` - 获取登录二维码，返回 Base64 图片和超时时间（无参数）\n- `delete_cookies` - 删除 cookies 文件，重置登录状态，删除后需要重新登录（无参数）\n- `publish_content` - 发布图文内容到小红书（必需：title, content, images）\n  - `images`: 图片路径列表（至少1张），支持 HTTP 链接或本地绝对路径，推荐使用本地路径\n  - `tags`: 话题标签列表（可选），如 `[\"美食\", \"旅行\", \"生活\"]`\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789629587.744188, "id": "688344ff65b6", "content": "调研完成，信息足够收敛了。先存档再汇报：", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_6ff5c868da01461e88e3c25f", "name": "save_memory", "arguments": "{\"content\":\"XHS (xiaohongshu) access survey (2026-09, via GitHub API): community consensus is real-browser + user's own login session; pure-HTTP signature reversing has been marginalized. Key projects: Panniantong/Agent-Reach 82.6k stars (agent-facing CLI, XHS route = OpenCLI desktop-session > xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp server > xhs-cli; deliberately never logs in itself nor reads browser cookies, only user-controlled sessions / manual Cookie-Editor export; per-platform multi-backend fallback + `agent-reach doctor` — same design as our websearch chain). xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp 15.8k (Go+Playwright, QR login, cookies in ./data, read AND publish, HTTP MCP on :18060; author: 1.5yr no bans, only cookie expiry). NanmiCoder/MediaCrawler 65.1k (Playwright crawler, notes+comments). JoeanAmier/XHS-Downloader 12.7k (single-note download, often login-free). Integration options for Clutch: (a) zero-code — call agent-reach via run_command; (b) thin backend — CLUTCH_XHS_CLI external-command backend in websearch chain; (c) Tier-1 cookie injection (~50 lines) same as xhs-cli approach.\",\"title\":\"Xiaohongshu open-source access landscape\"}"}], "reasoning": "Excellent — now I have the full picture:\n\n**Agent-Reach (82.6k★)** — the meta-solution for agents:\n- XHS route: OpenCLI (desktop, uses user's existing Chrome session) → xiaohongshu-mcp (server) → xhs-cli (fallback)\n- Explicitly does NOT log into XHS itself, does NOT read browser cookies automatically — privacy-respecting: uses user's existing sessions or manual Cookie-Editor export\n- Multi-backend routing per platform with doctor diagnostics — same philosophy as our backend chain\n- Cookie stored locally only\n\n**xiaohongshu-mcp (15.8k★)**:\n- Go + Playwright (headless browser), QR-code login, cookies persisted in ./data\n- get_login_qrcode / delete_cookies / publish_content tools\n- 1.5 years stable per author, no bans, only cookie expiry; real-name verification note\n- Runs as local HTTP MCP service on :18060\n\n**MediaCrawler (65.1k★)**: Playwright + QR login + cookie reuse, XHS sign via page's own JS. Crawler for notes/comments.\n\nSo the ecosystem consensus on XHS access = **real browser + user's login session (cookies), never pure HTTP**. This validates exactly the Tier 2 (CDP/browser) + Tier 1 (cookie) analysis from my previous answer.\n\nFor Clutch specifically, the practical integration options:\n1. **Use Agent-Reach or xiaohongshu-mcp as external tools**: Clutch's model can call `agent-reach` CLI via run_command (it's designed for exactly this — \"兼容所有 Agent 能跑命令行的\"), or register an MCP client backend in websearch chain.\n2. **Borrow the pattern**: xiaohongshu-mcp exposes HTTP MCP at localhost:18060 — Clutch could add an MCP backend to websearch... but Clutch deliberately has no MCP client. Simplest zero-dep path: run_command + agent-reach CLI (it's a CLI!), or add cookie support (Tier 1) + xhs-cli.\n3. Reading single public notes: JoeanAmier/XHS-Downloader (12.7k★) works without login for many notes.\n\nI have enough. Do I need to verify xhs-cli / OpenCLI? Agent-Reach's table already credits them (jackwener/opencli, jackwener/xiaohongshu-cli). A quick star check would round it out, but the answer is already rich. One quick search for rednote naming? Not necessary.\n\nLet me also save memory — this research is durable project knowledge (user asked this at session start; now answered with data). Save: XHS open-source landscape survey results.\n\nNow compose the final answer:\n\nStructure:\n1. 结论先行:有,而且生态相当成熟——社区已经收敛到「真实浏览器/用户会话 Cookie」路线,纯 HTTP 签名逆向基本退场\n2. 表格:项目/stars/路线/对 Clutch 的意义\n   - Agent-Reach 82.6k★ — agent 一键联网 CLI,小红书 = OpenCLI(桌面已有会话) → xiaohongshu-mcp(服务器) → xhs-cli\n   - MediaCrawler 65.1k★ — Playwright + 扫码登录 + cookie 复用,笔记/评论采集\n   - xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp 15.8k★ — Go+Playwright,扫码登录,cookie 落地 ./data,能读能发,HTTP MCP :18060\n   - JoeanAmier/XHS-Downloader 12.7k★ — 单笔记下载,很多无需登录\n   - 小型:Spider_XHS 系/签名库(灰色,活跃度低)\n3. 关键洞察:\n   - 共识路线 = 真浏览器 + 用户自己的登录态(Agent-Reach 甚至刻意「不替用户登录、不读浏览器 cookie」,只用已有会话——隐私红线与我们 Tier 1 设计一致)\n   - 作者实证:xiaohongshu-mcp 一年半无封号,只有 cookie 过期 → 封号风险可控,维护成本是常态\n   - 纯 HTTP 无签名方案全部边缘化(签名要执行站点混淆 JS,等于还是要浏览器)\n   - 这正是上次 Tier 1/Tier 2 分层的实证版\n4. 对 Clutch 的落地建议(零依赖优先级):\n   a. 最快:run_command 里直接用 agent-reach CLI(它就是给命令行 agent 设计的;doctor 自检)——零代码集成,模型自学 --help\n   b. 折中:xiaohongshu-mcp 跑本地 :18060,Clutch 不引 MCP 客户端也能用 run_command + curl 打它的 HTTP MCP? MCP over HTTP 是 JSON-RPC,curl 可行但体验糙;或给 websearch 加一个「外部命令后端」: CLUTCH_XHS_CLI=agent-reach → web_search 的 backend=xhs 调 subprocess?—— 引入 subprocess 调外部 CLI 与零依赖哲学兼容(不引库,只调命令)\n   c. 自研路线:Cookie 注入(Tier 1)+ xhs-cli 同款思路\n5. 合规:Agent-Reach/xiaohongshu-mcp 的做法(用户自己登录、cookie 本地、单账号低频)是社区可接受线;批量采集会碰风控与 ToS\n\nNote on star inflation: MediaCrawler 65k vs my memory ~10-20k — the environment date is 2026-09; report as-is.\n\nKeep the table tight, cite the mechanism quotes. Save memory first (one call), then final answer with no tool calls... wait — save_memory IS a tool call. \"When done, reply with a final explanation and NO tool calls\" — save memory before the final message. Do it in this response: save_memory, then final text? Tool calls and final text can't mix in the very last message; I'll do save_memory now and write the final answer after the result. Actually I can include the save_memory call and then the answer comes in the next turn. Fine."}
