{"title": "Xiaohongshu open-source access landscape", "content": "XHS (xiaohongshu) access survey (2026-09, via GitHub API): community consensus is real-browser + user's own login session; pure-HTTP signature reversing has been marginalized. Key projects: Panniantong/Agent-Reach 82.6k stars (agent-facing CLI, XHS route = OpenCLI desktop-session > xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp server > xhs-cli; deliberately never logs in itself nor reads browser cookies, only user-controlled sessions / manual Cookie-Editor export; per-platform multi-backend fallback + `agent-reach doctor` — same design as our websearch chain). xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp 15.8k (Go+Playwright, QR login, cookies in ./data, read AND publish, HTTP MCP on :18060; author: 1.5yr no bans, only cookie expiry). NanmiCoder/MediaCrawler 65.1k (Playwright crawler, notes+comments). JoeanAmier/XHS-Downloader 12.7k (single-note download, often login-free). Integration options for Clutch: (a) zero-code — call agent-reach via run_command; (b) thin backend — CLUTCH_XHS_CLI external-command backend in websearch chain; (c) Tier-1 cookie injection (~50 lines) same as xhs-cli approach.", "updated": 1789629587.7514346}
