{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789631358.2457871, "id": "227facc8d7ea", "content": "好消息：**这个方案里你要配置的「登录信息」是零**——登录态(扫码 → cookie)完全由 `xiaohongshu-mcp` 服务自己持有，Clutch 只需要知道**服务地址**这一项，而它应该进**设置弹窗**，和 `base_url`/`api_key` 一个待遇。这正是现有配置体系的用法。\n\n## 现有机制(刚核实的代码路径)\n\nClutch 已经有一套完全 GUI 化的配置流，命令行只是可选等价物：\n\n```\n设置弹窗 → POST /api/settings → ~/.clutch/settings.json(仓库外)\n会话启动优先级:CLI 参数 > 环境变量 > settings.json   ← server.py 721 行注释原文\n```\n\n`ui/main.js` 还有自愈逻辑(settings.json 丢失时从 UI 内存重建)。所以正确做法不是引入命令行配置，而是**把新字段接进这条既有链路**。\n\n## 你实际要做的三步(全程不碰命令行)\n\n| 步骤 | 操作 | 命令行？ |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. 起服务(一次性) | Docker Desktop 图形界面拉起 `xiaohongshu-mcp`(或 release 二进制双击/服务方式) | ❌ 可避免 |\n| 2. 告诉 Clutch 地址 | 设置弹窗新增「小红书 MCP」输入框，填 `http://localhost:18060/mcp`(留空=不启用) | ❌ |\n| 3. 登录 | **对话里说“登录小红书”** → 模型调 `get_login_qrcode` → 二维码直接渲染在聊天里 → 手机扫一次 → cookie 持久化到服务的 `./data`,此后免扫 | ❌ |\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 你\n    participant UI as Clutch 设置弹窗\n    participant S as settings.json\n    participant A as agent\n    participant X as xiaohongshu-mcp\n    U->>UI: 填一次服务地址\n    UI->>S: 与 base_url 同样持久化\n    U->>A: 对话: 登录小红书\n    A->>X: get_login_qrcode\n    X-->>A: 二维码 base64\n    A-->>U: 聊天里渲染二维码\n    U->>X: 手机扫码确认\n    Note over X: cookie 落地持久化<br/>过期才需重扫\n```\n\n第 3 步是关键差异：**扫码登录天然不是命令行操作**，而且可以做成聊天内交互——这正是用 MCP 服务而非自己攒 cookie 文案的好处。\n\n## 代码触点(实现时要改的地方)\n\n- `agent/config.py`:`xhs_mcp_url: str` 字段(env `CLUTCH_XHS_MCP_URL` 仍保留为等价可选，与项目「弹窗或环境变量」双轨一致)；\n- `agent/server.py`:`_settings_post`/`_settings_get` 增加该键的读写(现在白名单了 base_url/model/api_key/reasoning_effort 四个)；启动装配处从 `saved` 应用；\n- `ui/index.html` + `ui/app.js`:设置弹窗加一个输入框;`ui/main.js` 的镜像重建包含新键；\n- `websearch.py`:`_xhs_mcp` 后端读 `config.xhs_mcp_url`。\n\n**顺手可做的 UX 加分项**：设置弹窗里该字段旁显示实时状态点——调一次 `check_login_status`,「● 已连接·已登录 / ○ 服务未运行 / ○ 未登录(点此登录)」，把“配没配好”变成一眼可见。`_settings_get` 已有 `has_api_key` 的先例，模式照抄。\n\n一句话：**登录信息不进 Clutch、不进命令行——服务持有 cookie,Clutch 持有地址，地址进设置弹窗。** 要实现的话切 work mode,前端弹窗 + 后端字段 + `_xhs_mcp` 后端 + 测试一起交付。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Now I have the full config flow:\n\n1. **UI settings modal** → POST `/api/settings` → server `save_settings()` → `~/.clutch/settings.json` (flat keys: base_url, model, api_key, reasoning_effort)\n2. Session spawn: CLI args > env > GUI-saved settings (`~/.clutch/settings.json`) — server.py line 721-731\n3. UI mirrors settings.json (main.js self-heal) so session children and llm-proxy read it\n\nSo the user's wish \"不希望命令行配置\" maps perfectly onto the existing mechanism: **extend the settings modal + settings.json + Config with a `xhs_mcp_url` field**. The UX:\n\n1. One-time setup of xiaohongshu-mcp service (this is outside Clutch — docker/binary; unavoidable but it's a service install, not Clutch config; could even be automated later)\n2. In Clutch settings modal: new field \"小红书 MCP 地址\" (default http://localhost:18060/mcp), saved to settings.json like base_url — no command line\n3. Login: NOT command line either! QR code scan. Two ways:\n   - Service's own way: browser window (headless=false) or the MCP inspector\n   - **In-chat way (the nice UX)**: model calls get_login_qrcode via our backend → returns base64 QR → render as image in chat → user scans with phone → done, cookies persist in the service's ./data\n   - Even simpler v1: the service's non-headless mode opens a visible browser window with QR on first login\n   \nKey insight to communicate: **登录信息(扫码/cookie)完全不需要在 Clutch 里配置**——它由 xiaohongshu-mcp 服务持有。Clutch 只需要知道服务地址(进设置弹窗,和 base_url 一个待遇)。之后 cookie 过期也是重新扫码,不碰命令行。\n\nSo the configuration story:\n\n**你要配置的只有两样,而且都可以不碰命令行:**\n\n| 项 | 在哪配 | 命令行? |\n|---|---|---|\n| 服务本身(docker run 一次) | Docker Desktop 图形界面也行 | 可避免 |\n| Clutch 知道服务地址 | 设置弹窗(加一个字段)→ ~/.clutch/settings.json | 否 |\n| 登录(扫码) | 聊天里渲染二维码 / 服务窗口 | 否 |\n\nFlow diagram:\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 你\n    participant UI as Clutch 设置弹窗\n    participant S as settings.json\n    participant A as agent(websearch)\n    participant X as xiaohongshu-mcp\n    U->>UI: 填一次 xiaohongshu-mcp 地址(留空=不启用)\n    UI->>S: 和 base_url 一样持久化\n    U->>A: 对话里说 搜一下小红书上的...\n    A->>X: JSON-RPC check_login_status\n    X-->>A: 未登录\n    A->>X: get_login_qrcode\n    X-->>A: 二维码(base64)\n    A-->>U: 聊天里渲染二维码,请手机扫\n    U->>X: 手机扫码确认\n    X->>X: cookie 落地 ./data(持久)\n```\n\nThen implementation mapping (what needs adding where):\n- `agent/config.py`: `xhs_mcp_url: str` — env default `CLUTCH_XHS_MCP_URL` (optional escape hatch, consistent with project pattern) \n- `agent/core/` flatten_settings? settings.json keys — server.py `_settings_post` currently handles base_url/model/api_key/reasoning_effort explicitly → add xhs_mcp_url\n- `ui/index.html` + `ui/app.js`: settings modal field\n- `ui/main.js`: mirror already generic? settings.json mirror built from renderer's copy — need to include the new key\n- `agent/config.py` factory in server main(): apply saved setting when env absent\n- `websearch.py`: `_xhs_mcp` backend reading config.xhs_mcp_url\n\nAlso worth noting: `_settings_get` returns \"has_api_key\" pattern — for xhs, status can be live-checked (service reachable + logged in) — could show a green/gray dot in settings modal. Nice UX detail: \"小红书:已连接·已登录 / 未运行 / 未登录\" using check_login_status.\n\nKeep the answer focused: the user asked \"how do I configure login info without command line\". Answer: you don't configure login info at all — QR scan once, cookie persists at the service; Clutch only needs the URL which goes in the settings modal (existing mechanism, same as base_url). Provide the concrete UI/UX plan and the code touchpoints. Also mention the optional env var remains for parity but is NOT required.\n\nAlso the docker run one-time: on Windows, Docker Desktop GUI can run it, or better — xiaohongshu-mcp provides binaries? For Windows, might be WSL2. This one-time service install is the only \"technical\" step and it's outside Clutch regardless of approach. Could later be wrapped: Clutch UI \"服务\" page with install button — mention as future polish, not required.\n\nLength: moderate. Use the sequence diagram + a table + code touchpoint list. Chinese."}
