{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789633642.6923356, "id": "3932748986c8", "tool_call_id": "call_172015ec433d4449954db0f5", "content": "Search the web for information the workspace cannot answer: current events, library versions and release notes, error messages, docs pages. Returns ranked results (title, URL, snippet); follow up with web_fetch on the 1-2 most relevant URLs for the full text. query is the search string — engine syntax like quoted phrases, site: and -term filters work; short factual queries beat long sentences. max_results caps entries (default $max). Backends try in order: tavily (needs CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY), searxng (needs CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL), bing, duckduckgo — the first that returns results wins; when all fail the error lists each backend's reason, and backend=<name> pins one.\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
