{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789812279.243889, "id": "3058f452e103", "tool_call_id": "call_0249101aa1fe4a28b9feeb49", "content": "# Build the Clutch desktop releases on a tag push (vX.Y.Z) and attach them to\n# the GitHub release. Both artifacts are self-contained: bundled PyInstaller\n# backend + Electron GUI, click-to-use with no python/pip on the target machine.\n#  - deb  : Linux x86_64 (ubuntu-latest)\n#  - dmg  : macOS arm64 / Apple Silicon (macos-latest), UNSIGNED — first launch\n#           is blocked by Gatekeeper with a misleading \"damaged\" notice (macOS 15\n#           removed the right-click -> Open bypass); clear it with\n#           `xattr -cr /Applications/Clutch.app` until the project picks up\n#           Developer ID signing + notarization.\n#  - win  : Windows x64 NSIS (windows-latest), UNSIGNED — SmartScreen warns on\n#           the first run (\"Windows protected your PC\" -> More info -> Run\n#           anyway). This job must run on Windows: the bundled backend is a\n#           PyInstaller onefile .exe and PyInstaller cannot cross-compile.\nname: release\n\non:\n  push:\n    tags:\n      - \"v*\"\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n\njobs:\n  deb:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: \"3.11\"\n\n      - name: Install uv\n        run: pip install uv\n\n      - name: Sync python deps (PyInstaller, etc.)\n        run: uv sync\n\n      - name: Build bundled server (PyInstaller onefile)\n        run: bash scripts/build-server-bundle.sh \"${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" dist/agent-server\n\n      - name: Generate app icon\n        run: .venv/bin/python scripts/make-icon.py\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"22\"\n          cache: npm\n          cache-dependency-path: ui/package-lock.json\n\n      - name: Install UI deps\n        working-directory: ui\n        run: npm ci\n        env:\n          ELECTRON_MIRROR: https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/\n\n      # platform extraResources/icon guard (no build): see ui/verify-build-config.js\n      - name: Verify builder config\n        working-directory: ui\n        run: node verify-build-config.js\n\n      # font wiring guard: a root-absolute @font-face url resolves to file:///… and\n      # fails silently, which is how every platform ended up in its own OS face\n      # (tests/ui_fonts_check.py docstring). Offline, no browser, no deps.\n      - name: Verify UI fonts\n        run: .venv/bin/python -m tests.ui_fonts_check\n\n      - name: Build deb\n        working-directory: ui\n        run: npm run dist\n        env:\n          ELECTRON_MIRROR: https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/\n          ELECTRON_BUILDER_BINARIES_MIRROR: https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron-builder-binaries/\n\n      - name: Upload artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: clutch-deb\n          path: ui/dist/*.deb\n\n      - name: Attach to GitHub release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\n        with:\n          files: ui/dist/*.deb\n\n  # macOS build must run on macOS (no cross-compiling mac targets from Linux).\n  # needs: deb -> the deb job creates the release, this one only adds files\n  # (avoids the jobs racing to create it).\n  dmg:\n    runs-on: macos-latest\n    needs: deb\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - uses: actions/setup-python@v5\n        with:\n          python-version: \"3.11\"\n\n      - name: Install uv\n        run: pip install uv\n\n      - name: Sync python deps (PyInstaller, etc.)\n        run: uv sync\n\n      - name: Build bundled server (PyInstaller onefile)\n        run: bash scripts/build-server-bundle.sh \"${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}\" dist/agent-server\n\n      - name: Generate app ic\n... [truncated, file is 8025 chars; use offset=109 to continue]", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789812316.3169436, "id": "28678662cf22", "content": "原因完全查清了，证据链如下——**不是 CD 的问题，是 GitHub 上的源码从来就没有这些功能**。\n\n## 证据：`git status` 说了什么\n\n```\n本地领先 origin/master 10 个 commit（从未 push）\n\n未跟踪（从没进过 git）：\n  agent/tools/websearch.py          ← 整个联网搜索模块！\n  agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md / web_fetch.md\n  tests/websearch_test.py\n  agent/tools/mcpprovider.py        ← 今天的 MCP 接入\n  tests/mcpbackend_test.py\n\n已修改未提交：\n  agent/server.py  agent/config.py  agent/tools/registry.py\n  ui/app.js  ui/index.html  README.md ...\n```\n\n也就是说：\n\n1. 你 push 到 GitHub 触发 0.0.13 打包的那份源码里，**连 `web_search` 都没有**（`websearch.py` 至今是 untracked 状态），更别说 MCP；\n2. 本地还有 **10 个 commit 没推**，外加一堆未提交修改；\n3. CD（`release.yml`）只在 push **`v*` tag** 时触发，从 **GitHub 上的源码**构建——它打包的就是这份缺料源码，产物里当然没有功能。\n\n顺带解释版本号：工作区 `ui/package.json` 是 `0.1.13`，你说的 0.0.13 是当时 GitHub 上打包用的 tag，两者对不上恰好印证：你本地一直比 GitHub 多东西。\n\n## 补救：四步把功能真正发出去\n\n```bash\n# 0. 清理测试垃圾（不要让它们进仓库）\nrm -f scratch_*.log scratch-launch-tests.py scratch-relaunch-tests.py\n\n# 1. 暂存全部功能源码\ngit add agent/ tests/ ui/app.js ui/index.html README.md\n\n# 2. bump 版本并与 tag 保持一致（ui/package.json: 0.1.13 → 0.1.14）\n\n# 3. 提交并推送（连同落后的 10 个本地 commit 一起上去）\ngit commit -m \"feat: web_search/web_fetch + MCP search plugin (xiaohongshu)\"\ngit push origin master\n\n# 4. 打 tag 触发 CD（release.yml 只认 v* tag）\ngit tag v0.1.14\ngit push origin v0.1.14\n```\n\nCD 会从新源码构建三平台安装包（PyInstaller 后端 + Electron 壳）并挂到 GitHub Release。装上新包后：Settings 底部就有 **Web services** 区块，填 `http://localhost:18060/mcp` 即接入小红书。\n\n## 两个注意点\n\n- **版本号一致性**：`release.yml` 用 tag 名（去掉 `v`）作为后端版本，electron-builder 用 `ui/package.json` 的 `version`——打 tag 前把它 bump 成一致（如 `0.1.14` ↔ `v0.1.14`）。\n- **tag 要打在 push 之后的最新 commit 上**，顺序不能反。\n\n我现在处于 chat 模式，无法替你执行 `git add/commit/push`。你可以**切换到 work 模式**告诉我“提交并推送”，我来完成清理、bump、commit、push、打 tag 全套操作；或者你自己跑上面那几条命令。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Confirmed the CD mechanism: **release.yml triggers only on tag push (`v*`)**, builds PyInstaller backend + Electron GUI, attaches to a GitHub release.\n\nFull diagnosis now airtight:\n\n1. `git status` shows:\n   - `agent/tools/websearch.py` — **untracked**（联网搜索整个模块从未进 git！）\n   - `agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md`, `web_fetch.md`, `tests/websearch_test.py` — untracked\n   - `agent/tools/mcpprovider.py`, `tests/mcpbackend_test.py` — untracked (今天的 MCP 工作)\n   - 14 个 modified 未 commit（server.py/config.py/registry.py/app.js/index.html/README 等）\n   - **本地领先 origin/master 10 个 commit 还没 push**\n   - 垃圾文件 scratch_*.log / scratch-*.py 不该入库\n\n2. CD 只在打 tag（v*）时触发，从 GitHub 上的源码构建。\n\nSo the causal chain: 你 push 到 GitHub 的源码 = origin/master 的旧状态（缺 10 个本地 commit + 所有 untracked 文件 + 未 commit 修改）→ 打 tag v0.0.13 → CD 从这份缺料源码打包 → 产物里自然既没有 web_search 也没有 MCP。UI 版本号 0.1.13 vs 你说的 0.0.13 也印证打 tag 时打包的 ui/package.json 是旧版本号。\n\n解决方案（用户自己执行，或切 work mode 我来）：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 清理垃圾（不要提交 scratch 文件）\nrm scratch-launch-tests.py scratch-relaunch-tests.py scratch_*.log\n# 或者加入 .gitignore\n\n# 2. 暂存所有源码（含 untracked 的功能文件）\ngit add README.md agent/ tests/ ui/app.js ui/index.html ui/main.js 2>/dev/null\n# 明确列出更稳妥：\ngit add agent/tools/websearch.py agent/tools/mcpprovider.py \\\n        agent/prompts/tools/web_search.md agent/prompts/tools/web_fetch.md \\\n        tests/websearch_test.py tests/mcpbackend_test.py tests/perm-args-test.js \\\n        README.md agent/config.py agent/server.py agent/tools/registry.py \\\n        agent/base.py agent/core/permission.py agent/llm/ ui/app.js ui/index.html\n\n# 3. bump 版本（ui/package.json 0.1.13 → 0.1.14；看后端有没有版本号）\n# 4. commit + push（连同落后的 10 个本地 commit）\ngit commit -m \"web tools + MCP search plugin\"\ngit push origin master\n\n# 5. 打 tag 触发 CD\ngit tag v0.1.14\ngit push origin v0.1.14\n```\n\n注意版本号：release.yml 用 tag 名 `${GITHUB_REF_NAME#v}` 作为版本传给 build-server-bundle.sh，UI 用 electron-builder（读 ui/package.json version？electron-builder 默认用 package.json 的 version）。所以 bump ui/package.json 的 version 与 tag 一致（去掉 v）。\n\n还要检查后端是否有自己的版本号文件（build-server-bundle.sh 的参数）。以及 windows-debug.yml 是手动调试工作流无关紧要。\n\n另外提醒：tag 打在哪个 commit 很重要——必须 push master 后在最新 commit 上打 tag。\n\n我处于 chat 模式不能替他执行 git add/commit/push——需要 work mode。给出两条路：他自己跑命令；或者切 work mode 我来执行（我可以先 rm scratch、bump 版本、commit、push）。\n\nAlso note: 修改的文件里有些可能不属于这两个功能（agent/llm/*, agent/base.py, core/permission.py, tests/remote_path_test.py 等——这些是之前其他会话的工作，也是本地 10 个 commit 之外没提交的）。那 10 个未 push 的 commit 是什么？可以用 git log origin/master..master --oneline 看。我不需要现在跑——给用户时可以提到\"还有 10 个本地 commit 没推\"。\n\nLet me give a clean, actionable answer. Keep it structured: 原因链条 → 证据 → 修复命令 → 提醒（版本号一致性、tag 触发、scratch 文件）。And offer: 切到 work mode 我可以直接帮你完成。"}
