{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789812570.6623058, "id": "08f5e8e95aee", "tool_call_id": "call_e271915c3894481d8a927d44", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\norigin\tgit@github.com:Ethereal1024/Clutch.git (fetch)\norigin\tgit@github.com:Ethereal1024/Clutch.git (push)\n====\n.venv/\r\n__pycache__/\r\n*.pyc\r\n.env\r\nnode_modules/\r\nreports/\r\nbuild/\r\ndist/\r\n*.spec\r\n*.clc\r\n# the app icon lives in ui/build/ (electron-builder's default buildResources);\r\n# un-ignore the source files so they are versioned\r\n!ui/build/\r\n!ui/build/icon.svg\r\n!ui/build/icon.png\r\n!ui/build/icon.ico\r\n\r\n# one-time .clc migration tool — RECOVERY.md's escape hatch for old files on\r\n# this machine; keep it local, do not ship it in the repo\r\nscripts/convert-clc-to-cpr.py\r\n\r\n# local debug/scratch workspaces (mermaid render repro, jsdom repro) — keep out\r\n.mermaid-test/\r\nmj-repro/\r\n\r\n# internal planning docs (video script, optimization plans) — keep out of the repo\r\ndocs/\r\n\r\n# third-party writing skills (humanizer-zh etc.) — local tooling, not part of the submission\r\n.claude/skills/\r\n\r\n# local release-ops scratch scripts (machine-local: hardcoded run ids, PAT access);\r\n# readme.txt is the plain-text submission deliverable, kept out of the repo on purpose\r\n/poll_ci.py\r\n/readme.txt\r\n/verify_release.py\r\n/verify_win_artifact.py\r\n/watch_ci.sh\r\n\r\n# dev-only skills: usable by a local `uv run` agent, but neither committed nor\r\n# shipped — scripts/build-server-bundle.sh packages an explicit skill whitelist\r\n/agent/skills/humanize-writing/\r\n/agent/skills/humanizer-document-zh/\r\n/agent/skills/humanizer-zh/\r\n/agent/skills/wudao-humanize/\r\n====\n1:{\"name\":\"clutch-ui\",\"version\":\"0.1.13\",\"private\":true,\"description\":\"Clutch desktop GUI — Electron shell for the clutch-server backend\",\"author\":\"Clutch Developers <dev@clutch.invalid>\",\"homepage\":\"https://github.com/clutch-dev/clutch\",\"desktopName\":\"clu