{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789812646.3646107, "id": "b415d035a8b3", "tool_call_id": "call_de3db022c63e4e86b3be153f", "content": "OK: command succeeded\nstdout:\n4555509 chore(release): 0.1.13\nf43a397 fix(ui): give UA-monospace elements their own mono stack so CJK stops falling back to SimSun\n8fff81a chore(agent): drop an unused local left by the cancel-poll rewrite\ne9cd4e5 chore(release): 0.1.12\n84a102d fix(agent): Stop kills an in-flight run_command instead of waiting it out\nb46af5d chore(release): 0.1.11\nf926075 fix(agent): refuse to start a session whose kill guarantee is missing\n2c7a2aa fix(agent): kill-on-close Job so a dead supervisor cannot orphan a session\nab75346 test(ui): regression test + benchmark for the streaming-render throttle\n4289473 fix(ui): stop streaming renders from starving the renderer (whole-window freeze)\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
