{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789812809.7867808, "id": "c13141c9f863", "content": "HTTPS 凭据已存在（`username=Ethereal1024` + PAT）——**推送改走 HTTPS**，绕开失效的 SSH key。改动内容也清楚了，可以归为四组：web 工具链（websearch/mcpprovider/registry/server/UI/README/两个 prompt）、LLM 连接/读取超时拆分、权限问询 UX（permission.py + app.js 辅助）、测试修正（local_shell/remote_path）。\n\n补看最后两个没看全的 diff，并列出测试清单：", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_4f23e256f2334bbb8c4a0186", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"git diff tests/remote_path_test.py agent/llm/factory.py | head -70\"}"}, {"id": "call_a8890697b0214c298139cba6", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"git diff agent/llm/client.py tests/llm_client_test.py | sed -n '18,130p'\"}"}, {"id": "call_be8ea9035c9d44469d5adaf0", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"ls tests/\"}"}], "reasoning": "Excellent! Critical findings:\n\n1. **HTTPS credentials EXIST**: `git credential fill` returned `username=Ethereal1024, password=PRESENT`. So HTTPS push will work with the stored credential (PAT or OAuth token).\n\n2. **SSH diagnosis**: The ssh -v grep didn't show the offering line for id_ed25519 (only identity file lines for missing keys; the grep cut before showing more). Whatever — HTTPS is the way.\n\n3. **The work in the tree** (3 logical groups):\n   a. **Web tools**: `web_search` + `web_fetch` tools in websearch.py (multi-backend: Bing RSS, DDG, Tavily, SearXNG, MCP providers incl. xiaohongshu), mcpprovider.py, prompts, registry, config (web_search_timeout/max_results/tavily/searxng/mcp_urls), server settings/mcp_status, UI settings modal (#mcp-services), README, tests/websearch_test.py + mcpbackend_test.py.\n   b. **LLM read timeout**: config.llm_read_timeout=240, openai_client split Timeout (connect ≤15, read 240), client.py error normalization distinguishes Connect/Read timeout, base.py wiring, factory +1 (probably passes read_timeout), llm_client_test +12.\n   c. **UI permission ask UX**: permission.py simplified reason (no more \"wit