{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789813323.967919, "id": "94d72806fb5c", "content": "用法已全部核实（对照 `ui/app.js` 的 `initMcpServices`、`mcpprovider.py` 注册表和 `websearch.py` 的链路顺序）。这个 **Web services (optional)** 区块的作用是：把一个外部 MCP 搜索服务接入 `web_search` 工具链。目前内置注册的是**小红书**。完整用法如下：\n\n## 前提：先让 xiaohongshu-mcp 在本机跑起来\n\nClutch 只是\"接入方\"，服务本身是第三方开源项目 [xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp](https://github.com/xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp)（Go + Playwright，扫码登录，cookie 存本地）。下载运行它，**扫码登录一次**，它会在 `:18060` 提供 MCP 服务。（按设计，Clutch 的界面和提示词里永远不会出现\"请安装某某\"的引导，所以这一步需要你在应用外自己准备。）\n\n## 三步接入\n\n1. 打开 **Settings** → 底部 **Web services (optional)**，在 Xiaohongshu MCP 行填入服务地址（占位符就是示例）：`http://localhost:18060/mcp`\n2. 点 **Save web services** → 出现 `saved` 即保存成功（**热生效，不用重启**；持久化在 `~/.clutch/settings.json` 的 `mcp_xiaohongshu` 键）\n3. 看这行右侧的状态文字：\n\n| 状态 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| `connected · logged in` | ✅ 一切就绪 |\n| `connected · not logged in` | 服务在跑，但还没扫码登录 |\n| `unreachable` | 地址不对或服务没起来 |\n| （空白） | 未配置，行保留但不参与搜索 |\n\n## 在对话里怎么用\n\n直接用自然语言提需求即可，比如：**\"在小红书搜一下『抗初老 护肤』的笔记\"** —— 模型会调 `web_search` 并选中 xiaohongshu 后端，返回标题/链接/摘要，你让它接着 `web_fetch` 某条链接看正文也行（链接自带 `xsec_token`，可直接打开）。\n\n⚠️ **一个关键点**：搜索链的尝试顺序是 tavily → searxng → **bing → ddg**（免 key，永远可用）→ xiaohongshu（在链尾）。所以不点名平台的话，请求会被 bing/ddg 接住、轮不到小红书。**提需求时明确说\"小红书\"**（模型会固定 `backend=xiaohongshu`）；如果它没选中，直接说\"用 xiaohongshu 后端搜\"即可。\n\n## 顺带说明\n\n- 不配置任何服务也完全不影响 `web_search` / `web_fetch`——bing/ddg 开箱即用；想升级质量可在环境变量里配 `CLUTCH_TAVILY_API_KEY`（优先级最高）或 `CLUTCH_SEARXNG_URL`，这两项走环境变量、不在这个 UI 里\n- 环境变量等价写法：`CLUTCH_MCP_XIAOHONGSHU_URL=http://localhost:18060/mcp`\n- 新增其他 MCP 平台只需在 `agent/tools/mcpprovider.py` 的 `MCP_PROVIDERS` 加一条注册项——搜索链、工具提示词、这个 UI 会自动跟着长出来", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Confirmed the critical detail:\n\n- Chain order: tavily → searxng → bing → ddg → (MCP providers appended after, line 570 `_BACKENDS[_p.name] = _mcp_backend(_p)` — appended at the END).\n- Native bing/ddg are ALWAYS available (no config requirement), so without pinning, `web_search` will succeed on bing/ddg and NEVER reach xiaohongshu.\n- **Conclusion: to search Xiaohongshu, the model must pin `backend=\"xiaohongshu\"`** — or the user phrases the request so the model knows to pin it (e.g. \"在xiaohongshu上搜…\" — the model sees the backend list in its tool description and typically pins xiaohongshu for XHS-specific asks). Good to tell the user: mention 小红书 explicitly in the ask, and/or the model will pick the backend; if it doesn't, say \"用 xiaohongshu 后端搜\".\n\nPrerequisites for xiaohongshu backend:\n1. A running xiaohongshu-mcp service — per my memory: xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp (Go+Playwright, QR login, cookies stored in ./data, HTTP MCP on :18060). So the user needs to download/run that service and scan the QR code to log in once. Alternative: Panniantong/Agent-Reach.\n2. In Clutch settings → Web services → fill http://localhost:18060/mcp → Save web services.\n3. Status text: \"connected · logged in\" = good; \"connected · not logged in\" = service up but QR not scanned; \"unreachable\" = service not running/wrong URL.\n4. Settings are hot-applied (server sets cfg.mcp_urls on POST) — no restart needed.\n5. Persistence: ~/.clutch/settings.json as mcp_xiaohongshu key. Env equivalent: CLUTCH_MCP_XIAOHONGSHU_URL.\n6. Then in chat: just ask naturally, e.g. \"在小红书搜一下抗初老攻略\" — the model calls web_search with backend=xiaohongshu. Results come back as title/url/snippet; can follow up with web_fetch on a note URL (public pages work; xsec_token kept in URL).\n7. Also mention: web_search/web_fetch work out of the box via bing/ddg without any setup — the Web services row is only needed for the MCP-backed source.\n\nShould I also give the xiaohongshu-mcp install command? From memory: xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp — Go+Playwright, QR login, HTTP MCP on :18060. Typical usage: download release / go run, then it opens browser for QR scan, serves http://localhost:18060/mcp. I can mention the project name (xpzouying/xiaohongshu-mcp on GitHub) and that it must be running + logged in. Keep it brief — user can ask for details. Note the app itself never suggests installing anything (deliberate design), so the setup of the external service is on the user; I can give the pointer.\n\nAlso worth noting: this UI section is optional — other backends (Tavily/SearXNG) are env-based, not in this UI.\n\nOne more check I could do: does the UI row appear even when nothing configured? render() draws the row for every provider in mcp_providers (always xiaohongshu since registry is static) — yes, row always shows with placeholder. Status stays blank until configured.\n\nDo I need to verify the user is running v0.1.14? They said they see the UI — good enough.\n\nNow compose the final answer in Chinese. Structure:\n\n1. 前提：这个区块是给\"外部 MCP 搜索服务\"用的，目前内置注册的是小红书；要先有 xiaohongshu-mcp 在本机跑起来并扫码登录\n2. 三步接入（填 URL → Save → 看状态）\n3. 状态文案对照表\n4. 怎么用（对话里怎么问，backend 说明——重点：默认链 bing/ddg 在前，搜小红书要明确说\"小红书\"或指定 backend）\n5. 其他后端一句话（Tavily/SearXNG 是环境变量，不在这个 UI）\n6. 无需重启、存在哪\n\nKeep it tight, use a small table for status texts. No more tool calls needed."}
