 / stuck read-only\\\\\\\": (1) an orphan dev supervisor cha\n  Line 371: {\"title\": \"win-clutch.clc read-only root cause + Job fix (2c7a2aa)\", \"content\": \"Diagnosis of \\\"win-clutch.clc closes itself / stuck read-only\\\": (1) an orphan dev supervisor chain (dead 7780 → venv launcher 13724 → real interpreter 18072, started 14:54, port 2234) held the kernel byte-range lock on\n  Line 493: {\"type\": \"assistant_message\", \"timestamp\": 1789203109.237722, \"id\": \"9172caa9b084\", \"content\": \"CI 在 tag push 时自动构建 deb/dmg/win 并发 GitHub release，tag 是轻量 tag，指向 release 提交。看下 release.yml 的发布步骤（release notes 惯例），并在打 tag 前跑一遍测试。\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call_e147015afec04a5e8c1211b5\", \"name\": \"run_com\n  Line 510: {\"type\": \"assistant_message\", \"timestamp\": 1789203194.2425559, \"id\": \"8d5d9f735163\", \"content\": \"趁测试在跑，先确认 UI 侧回归测试怎么跑，并核对 4 个待发布提交的内容以写 release notes。\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call_d9baead980c44242ad026751\", \"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"node tests/stream-render-test.js 2>&1 |\n  Line 548: {\"type\": \"assistant_message\", \"timestamp\": 1789203344.6461954, \"id\": \"e91e1661fb61\", \"content\": \"`release` 工作流已被 v0.1.11 触发，正在运行。看一下以往 Release 的正文格式，并起一个后台轮询等 CI 完成。\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call_2c55e774113f4bb4bf5f70f6\", \"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"curl -s \\\\\\\"https://api.g\n  Line 553: {\"type\": \"assistant_message\", \"timestamp\": 1789203357.1081505, \"id\": \"6e5517bd08eb\", \"content\": \"v0.1.10 的 Release 正文为空——惯例就是 CI 挂产物、不带正文。看下上次 release 跑了多久，好估计等待时间。\", \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call_e52ac662bed44295b9f74fff\", \"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"curl -s \\\\\\\"https://api.gi\n\ntests\\loop_test.py:\n  Line 691:     notes: list[object] = []\n  Line 709:         sink=notes.append,\n  Line 712:     deltas13g = [e for e in notes if e.type == \"compaction_delta\"]\n\ntests\\mcpbackend_test.py:\n  Line 38:     \"name\": \"notes\",\n  Line 42:     \"fields\": {\"url\": \"https://notes.example/n/{id}?t={token}\", \"snippet\": \"desc | description\"},\n  Line 126:         mapped[0][\"url\"] == \"https://notes.example/n/n1?t=a%20b%2Fc\",\n  Line 129:     check(mapped[1][\"url\"] == \"https://notes.example/n/?t=\", \"unfilled placeholders fill as empty, the row stays\")\n  Line 133:     chained = parse_service({**NOTES, \"fields\": {\"url\": \"https://notes.example/n/{id | note_id}\"}})\n  Line 134:     check(map_results(chained, rows)[0][\"url\"] == \"https://notes.example/n/n1\", \"chains try alternatives in order\")\n  Line 135:     check(map_results(chained, rows)[1][\"url\"] == \"https://notes.example/n/n2\", \"chain fallback hits the second name\")\n  Line 250:     check(\"notes\" not in avail, \"undeclared service absent from the chain\")\n  Line 253:     r = ws.web_search(None, plain, \"q\", backend=\"notes\")\n  Line 264:     check(\"notes\" in avail and avail[-1] == \"notes\", \"declared service joins the chain after the native backends\")\n  Line 265:     check(\"notes\" not in ws.available_backends(Config(mcp_services=[{**NOTES, \"enabled\": False}])),\n  Line 267:     check(\"notes\" not in ws.available_backends(Config(mcp_services=[{**NOTES, \"url\": \"\"}])),\n  Line 269:     check(\"notes\" in ws.available_backends(Config(mcp_services=[\"junk\", NOTES])),\n  Line 284:         r = ws.web_search(None, cfg, \"note\", backend=\"notes\")\n  Line 294:         r = ws.web_search(None, cfg, \"note\", backend=\"notes\")\n  Line 301:     check(\"notes\" not in tools_plain[\"web_search\"].description,\n  Line 303:     check(\"notes\" in tools_cfg[\"web_search\"].description,\n  Line 307:     check(\"notes\" in tools_cfg[\"web_search\"].parameters[\"properties\"][\"backend\"][\"description\"],\n\ntests\\selfcheck.py:\n  Line 680:     notes = [m for m in msgs2 if m[\"role\"] == \"user\" and \"Conversation compacted\" in m.get(\"content\", \"\")]\n  Line 682:         le