{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789816868.5411985, "id": "f786d7c52c1e", "tool_call_id": "call_7aa32b83fa5a4204a2396890", "content": "477: def _mcp_call(\n478:     url: str,\n479:     tool: str,\n480:     args: dict,\n481:     timeout: float,\n482:     cancel: Any = None,\n483: ) -> Any:\n484:     \"\"\"initialize -> tools/call against an HTTP MCP server; returns the parsed\n485:     tool output (JSON when it parses, else the plain text).\"\"\"\n486:     hello = {\n487:         \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n488:         \"id\": 1,\n489:         \"method\": \"initialize\",\n490:         \"params\": {\n491:             \"protocolVersion\": _MCP_PROTO,\n492:             \"capabilities\": {},\n493:             \"clientInfo\": {\"name\": \"clutch\", \"version\": \"0.1\"},\n494:         },\n495:     }\n496:     _, session = _mcp_rpc(url, hello, None, timeout, cancel)\n497:     if session:\n498:         _mcp_rpc(\n499:             url,\n500:             {\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"method\": \"notifications/initialized\"},\n501:             session,\n502:             timeout,\n503:             cancel,\n504:         )\n505:     resp, _ = _mcp_rpc(\n506:         url,\n507:         {\n508:             \"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\",\n509:             \"id\": 2,\n510:             \"method\": \"tools/call\",\n511:             \"params\": {\"name\": tool, \"arguments\": args},\n512:         },\n513:         session,\n514:         timeout,\n515:         cancel,\n516:     )\n517:     result = resp.get(\"result\") or {}\n518:     parts = result.get(\"content\") or []\n519:     text = \"\\n\".join(\n520:         p.get(\"text\", \"\") for p in parts if isinstance(p, dict) and p.get(\"type\") == \"text\"\n521:     ).strip()\n522:     if result.get(\"isError\") and text:\n523:         raise WebError(f\"MCP tool error: {_short(text)}\")\n524:     try:\n525:         return json.loads(text)\n526:     except ValueError:\n527:         return text\n528: \n529: \n530: # ---- registry ---------------------------------------------------------------\n531: # One protocol for every source: a Backend knows how to search and whether it\n532: # exists on this machine. web_search only ever sees this shape, so adding a\n533: # source (e.g. an MCP service) touches nothing else in this module.\n534: \n535: \n536: @dataclass(frozen=True)\n537: class Backend:\n538:     name: str\n539:     search: Callable[[str, int, Config, Callable[..., HttpResp]], list[dict[str, str]]]\n540:     available: Callable[[Config], bool] = lambda config: True\n541: \n542: \n543: _BACKENDS: dict[str, Backend] = {\n544:     \"tavily\": Backend(\"tavily\", _tavily, lambda c: bool(c.tavily_api_key)),\n545:     \"searxng\": Backend(\"searxng\", _searxng, lambda c: bool(c.searxng_url)),\n546:     \"bing\": Backend(\"bing\", _bing),\n547:     \"ddg\": Backend(\"ddg\", _ddg),\n548: }\n549: # Base try order; the live chain is this filtered through Backend.available.\n550: _DEFAULT_CHAIN = tuple(_BACKENDS)\n551: \n552: \n553: def _mcp_backend(service: McpService) -> Backend:\n554:     \"\"\"Adapt one operator-declared MCP service to the uniform Backend shape.\"\"\"\n555: \n556:     def search(q: str, limit: int, config: Config, get: Callable[..., HttpResp]) -> list[dict[str, str]]:\n557:         cancel = (getattr(get, \"keywords\", None) or {}).get(\"cancel\")\n558:         data = _mcp_call(\n559:             service.url,\n560:             service.search_tool,\n561:             search_args(service, q, limit),\n562:             config.web_search_timeout,\n563:             cancel=cancel,\n564:         )\n565:         rows = map_results(service, data)\n566:         if not rows:\n567:             raise BackendError(f\"no results for {q!r} (empty feed or unmapped payload)\")\n568:         return rows[:limit]\n569: \n570:     return Backend(service.name, search)\n571: \n572: \n573: def _all_backends(config: Config) -> dict[str, Backend]:\n574:     \"\"\"Native backends plus this machine's configured MCP services, in chain\n575:     order (services last, as declared). A service that is disabled or missing\n576:     its endpoint/tool is not built at all: it does not exist here.\"\"\"\n577:     out = dict(_BACKENDS)\n578:     services, _errors = parse_services(config.mcp_services)\n579:     for service in services:\n580:         if service.enabled and service.complete():\n581:             out[service.name] = _mcp_backend(service)\n582:     return out\n583: \n584: \n585: def _available_backends(config: Config) -> tuple[str, ...]:\n586:     \"\"\"The usable subset of the chain: registered AND configured on this machine.\n587: \n588:     Rendered into prompts and error texts, so an unconfigured service simply\n589:     does not exist here — no name, no install advice.\n590:     \"\"\"\n591:     return tuple(name for name, backend in _all_backends(config).items() if backend.available(config))\n592: \n593: \n594: # Public alias: server and registry render UI/prompt text from this too.\n595: available_backends = _available_backends\n596: \n... (showing lines 477-596 of 702; use offset=597 to continue)", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789816916.5713446, "id": "20416787dd29", "content": "核对完代码（server.py / ui/app.js / websearch.py / mcpprovider.py / config.py），现在的配置过程是这样的：\n\n## 一句话总览\n\n**配置 = 在设置弹窗里声明一条记录**（名字、地址、搜索工具名），存进 `~/.clutch/settings.json` 的 `mcp_services` 列表 —— 不装任何包、不改代码，服务声明在哪里就存在于哪里。\n\n## 操作步骤（UI 侧）\n\n1. 打开 **设置弹窗 → \"Web services (optional)\" 区 → ＋ Add service**\n2. 填四个输入框：\n\n| 字段 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `name` | 后端名，`^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$`，之后 `backend=<name>` 用它点名 | `xiaohongshu` |\n| `url` | MCP 端点（尾斜杠自动去掉） | `http://localhost:18060/mcp` |\n| `search_tool` | 搜索工具的 MCP 工具名 | `search_feeds` |\n| `status_tool`（可选） | 查询登录态的工具 | `check_login_status` |\n\n3. 点 **Save web services** → `POST /api/settings`，服务端用 `parse_services` 校验，**坏记录会让整次保存失败并给出原因**（比如名字不合法），不会存进去\n4. 状态行经 `GET /api/mcp_status` 自动刷新：`connected` / `connected · logged in` / `connected · not logged in` / `unreachable` / `disabled`\n\n表单只露这四个常用字段；高级映射（`args`、`fields`、`list_key`、`label`、`enabled`）**round-trip 保留**——保存时从行的 `dataset.rec` 合并回去，不会被静默抹掉，但需要手改 settings.json 才能设置。\n\n## 记录长什么样\n\n最小可用记录（字段映射都有默认值，`url + search_tool` 就算完整）：\n\n```json\n{\"name\": \"notedb\", \"url\": \"http://localhost:18060/mcp\", \"search_tool\": \"search_feeds\"}\n```\n\n完整记录（`agent/tools/mcp_presets.json` 里的预设就是这个形状）：\n\n```json\n{\"name\": \"xiaohongshu\",\n \"url\": \"http://localhost:18060/mcp\",\n \"search_tool\": \"search_feeds\",\n \"args\": {\"keyword\": \"{query}\", \"limit\": \"{limit}\"},\n \"fields\": {\"title\": \"title | name\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/{id | note_id}?xsec_token={xsec_token}\",\n            \"snippet\": \"desc | description\"},\n \"status_tool\": \"check_login_status\", \"login_field\": \"logged_in\"}\n```\n\n## 保存后运行时发生什么\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"设置弹窗声明记录\"] --> B[\"POST /api/settings 校验并写入<br/>settings.json 的 mcp_services\"]\n    B --> C[\"启动时 service_records()<br/>旧版 mcp_x 地址键经 mcp_presets.json<br/>一次性折叠成记录\"]\n    C --> D[\"available_backends()<br/>原生链 tavily/searxng/bing/ddg<br/>+ enabled 且 complete 的服务排最后\"]\n    D --> E[\"web_search 提示词与 backend 参数<br/>动态渲染出服务名\"]\n    E --> F[\"backend=name 搜索<br/>initialize → tools/call<br/>args 由模板填充\"]\n    F --> G[\"map_results 映射成<br/>title / url / snippet\"]\n```\n\n几个关键行为：\n\n- **零足迹**：没配置的服务在工具描述、参数 schema、报错信息里**完全不存在**，也永远不会出现“请安装”的建议；报错只列真实可用的后端（`available: bing | ddg`）\n- **点名失败是事实性错误**：`backend=` 一个不存在的名字 → 返回错误数据（error-as-data），不崩会话\n- **降级**：服务配了但挂了 → `MCP server unreachable ...` 作为错误数据返回；空结果 → `no results (empty feed or unmapped payload)`\n- **禁用不删除**：`enabled: false` 让服务从链上消失但记录还在\n\n## 旧版迁移路径（预设文件的作用）\n\n老配置里只有 `mcp_xiaohongshu: \"http://...\"` 这种扁平地址键的，启动时 `service_records()` 会查 `agent/tools/mcp_presets.json`（这次刚挪到引擎旁边的数据文件）把键一次性转成完整记录。两条规则：已声明的服务优先于旧键；**发过 `mcp_services` 列表之后旧键就死了**——删掉的服务不会从迁移前的键里复活。\n\n## 两条注意事项\n\n1. **名字别撞自然语言**：服务名会以子串形式出现在渲染后的提示词里，取名要避免 `notes` 这种能撞上 \"release notes\" 的词（这次测试就是为此改用 `notedb`）\n2. **改名即搬家**：`mcp_presets.json` 这类“与模块同目录”的数据文件，位置由 `Path(__file__).with_name(...)` 决定——挪目录时必须跟着引擎走，否则 `presets()` 静默返回空、迁移测试静默跳过", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "I now have the complete, verified picture. Let me write the answer in Chinese explaining the MCP configuration process as it currently stands (post-fix), covering:\n\n**Operator's perspective (UI):**\n1. Open settings modal → \"Web services (optional)\" section → \"＋ Add service\"\n2. Fill: name (a-z 0-9 -, e.g. `notedb`), URL (e.g. `http://localhost:18060/mcp`), search tool name (e.g. `search_feeds`), optional status tool (e.g. `check_login_status`)\n3. \"Save web services\" → POST /api/settings with `mcp_services` payload → server validates via `parse_services` (invalid record fails the save with reason), saves to `~/.clutch/settings.json`\n4. Status line auto-refreshes via GET /api/mcp_status → reachable / login state / unreachable / disabled\n5. Round-trip safety: fields the form doesn't show (label, args, fields mappings, list_key, enabled) are kept in `wrap.dataset.rec` and merged on save — a save never silently drops exotic mappings.\n\n**Alternative: hand-edit settings.json** — full record shape with args/fields/list_key/status_tool/login_field/enabled; documented in mcpprovider.py docstring.\n\n**Legacy path:** old `mcp_<name>` URL keys (e.g. `mcp_xiaohongshu`) at boot get folded into `mcp_services` records via `service_records()` + `agent/tools/mcp_presets.json` (the data file we just moved beside the engine); a posted `mcp_services` list replaces everything and legacy keys die so deleted services don't resurrect.\n\n**Runtime, after save:**\n1. Boot: server.py line 819-820: `config.mcp_services = service_records(load_settings())` — declared list + preset-folded legacy keys\n2. `available_backends(cfg)`: native chain (tavily/searxng/bing/ddg filtered by availability) + each enabled+complete service appended last (enabled & url & search_tool)\n3. Tool surface: prompt and schema `backend` param render dynamically from this chain — service name appears in `web_search` description only on configured hosts\n4. Search with `backend=<name>` (or in chain order): `_mcp_call` JSON-RPC: initialize → notifications/initialized (session id) → tools/call with args built from templates (`{query}`/`{limit}`) → text content parsed as JSON\n5. `map_results` reads rows: list_key or auto-unwrap (data/items/feeds/results/notes), field chains `a.b | alt`, url template placeholders percent-encoded\n6. Degradation: unreachable → WebError → error-as-data in the tool result; empty feed → BackendError; no install advice ever.\n\nMaybe include a small record example (the xiaohongshu preset shape) and a mermaid flowchart. The mermaid rules: no double quotes inside labels, subgraph with id + quoted title. Let me build a simple flowchart.\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"设置弹窗 Web services 区<br/>＋ Add service\"] --> B[\"填 name / url / search_tool<br/>(可选 status_tool)\"]\n    B --> C[\"Save web services<br/>POST /api/settings\"]\n    C --> D{\"parse_services 校验\"}\n    D -- 无效 --> E[\"保存失败并给出原因\"]\n    D -- 有效 --> F[\"写入 ~/.clutch/settings.json<br/>mcp_services 列表\"]\n    F --> G[\"重启/下次启动<br/>service_records() 折叠旧版 mcp_x 键<br/>(经 mcp_presets.json)\"]\n    G --> H[\"available_backends()<br/>原生链 + enabled 且 complete 的服务\"]\n    H --> I[\"工具描述/参数 schema<br/>动态渲染出服务名\"]\n    I --> J[\"web_search backend=name<br/>initialize → tools/call\"]\n    J --> K[\"map_results 映射为<br/>title/url/snippet\"]\n```\n\nHmm, `<br/>` works in mermaid labels. Quotes inside labels — none. Full-width parens fine. Avoid double quotes inside labels — the label uses `mcp_x 键` fine. `{query}` braces inside labels? Not used. OK.\n\nAlso mention the constraint learned: name must match `^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$`, avoid natural-language words (notes lesson). URL trailing slashes stripped.\n\nKeep the answer well-structured but not overly long. Use the actual field names. Mention that on the UI form, exotic mappings (args/fields/list_key) round-trip untouched and need hand-editing in settings.json.\n\nAlso worth noting: `enabled: false` disables without deleting; `list_key` for envelopes; `fields` mappings with defaults so a minimal record (name+url+search_tool) is enough — `complete()` requires url+search_tool.\n\nAlso the search side: `args` templates default? If args empty — search_args returns {} — hmm, a record with no args means tools/call gets empty args. UI doesn't expose args; hand-edit for that. The xiaohongshu preset has args {\"keyword\": \"{query}\", \"limit\": \"{limit}\"}.\n\nI'll structure:\n1. 一句话总览\n2. 操作步骤（UI）with the form fields\n3. 记录长什么样（minimal + full example JSON）\n4. 保存后发生什么（runtime pipeline, mermaid）\n5. 旧版迁移路径 + 手改 settings.json\n6. 注意事项（名字规则/自然语言撞名教训、零足迹原则、降级行为）\n\nWrite in Chinese, code identifiers in English. No tool calls after. Actually I can include the tool calls... no — final answer should have no tool calls. I have all info."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1789816916.5770779, "id": "809c2b582917", "status": "completed", "summary": "核对完代码（server.py / ui/app.js / websearch.py / mcpprovider.py / config.py），现在的配置过程是这样的：\n\n## 一句话总览\n\n**配置 = 在设置弹窗里声明一条记录**（名字、地址、搜索工具名），存进 `~/.clutch/settings.json` 的 `mcp_services` 列表 —— 不装任何包、不改代码，服务声明在哪里就存在于哪里。\n\n## 操作步骤（UI 侧）\n\n1. 打开 **设置弹窗 → \"Web services (optional)\" 区 → ＋ Add service**\n2. 填四个输入框：\n\n| 字段 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `name` | 后端名，`^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,63}$`，之后 `backend=<name>` 用它点名 | `xiaohongshu` |\n| `url` | MCP 端点（尾斜杠自动去掉） | `http://localhost:18060/mcp` |\n| `search_tool` | 搜索工具的 MCP 工具名 | `search_feeds` |\n| `status_tool`（可选） | 查询登录态的工具 | `check_login_status` |\n\n3. 点 **Save web services** → `POST /api/settings`，服务端用 `parse_services` 校验，**坏记录会让整次保存失败并给出原因**（比如名字不合法），不会存进去\n4. 状态行经 `GET /api/mcp_status` 自动刷新：`connected` / `connected · logged in` / `connected · not logged in` / `unreachable` / `disabled`\n\n表单只露这四个常用字段；高级映射（`args`、`fields`、`list_key`、`label`、`enabled`）**round-trip 保留**——保存时从行的 `dataset.rec` 合并回去，不会被静默抹掉，但需要手改 settings.json 才能设置。\n\n## 记录长什么样\n\n最小可用记录（字段映射都有默认值，`url + search_tool` 就算完整）：\n\n```json\n{\"name\": \"notedb\", \"url\": \"http://localhost:18060/mcp\", \"search_tool\": \"search_feeds\"}\n```\n\n完整记录（`agent/tools/mcp_presets.json` 里的预设就是这个形状）：\n\n```json\n{\"name\": \"xiaohongshu\",\n \"url\": \"http://localhost:18060/mcp\",\n \"search_tool\": \"search_feeds\",\n \"args\": {\"keyword\": \"{query}\", \"limit\": \"{limit}\"},\n \"fields\": {\"title\": \"title | name\",\n            \"url\": \"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/{id | note_id}?xsec_token={xsec_token}\",\n            \"snippet\": \"desc | description\"},\n \"status_tool\": \"check_login_status\", \"login_field\": \"logged_in\"}\n```\n\n## 保存后运行时发生什么\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"设置弹窗声明记录\"] --> B[\"POST /api/settings 校验并写入<br/>settings.json 的 mcp_services\"]\n    B --> C[\"启动时 service_records()<br/>旧版 mcp_x 地址键经 mcp_presets.json<br/>一次性折叠成记录\"]\n    C --> D[\"available_backends()<br/>原生链 tavily/searxng/bing/ddg<br/>+ enabled 且 complete 的服务排最后\"]\n    D --> E[\"web_search 提示词与 backend 参数<br/>动态渲染出服务名\"]\n    E --> F[\"backend=name 搜索<br/>initialize → tools/call<br/>args 由模板填充\"]\n    F --> G[\"map_results 映射成<br/>title / url / snippet\"]\n```\n\n几个关键行为：\n\n- **零足迹**：没配置的服务在工具描述、参数 schema、报错信息里**完全不存在**，也永远不会出现“请安装”的建议；报错只列真实可用的后端（`available: bing | ddg`）\n- **点名失败是事实性错误**：`backend=` 一个不存在的名字 → 返回错误数据（error-as-data），不崩会话\n- **降级**：服务配了但挂了 → `MCP server unreachable ...` 作为错误数据返回；空结果 → `no results (empty feed or unmapped payload)`\n- **禁用不删除**：`enabled: false` 让服务从链上消失但记录还在\n\n## 旧版迁移路径（预设文件的作用）\n\n老配置里只有 `mcp_xiaohongshu: \"http://...\"` 这种扁平地址键的，启动时 `service_records()` 会查 `agent/tools/mcp_presets.json`（这次刚挪到引擎旁边的数据文件）把键一次性转成完整记录。两条规则：已声明的服务优先于旧键；**发过 `mcp_services` 列表之后旧键就死了**——删掉的服务不会从迁移前的键里复活。\n\n## 两条注意事项\n\n1. **名字别撞自然语言**：服务名会以子串形式出现在渲染后的提示词里，取名要避免 `notes` 这种能撞上 \"release notes\" 的词（这次测试就是为此改用 `notedb`）\n2. **改名即搬家**：`mcp_presets.json` 这类“与模块同目录”的数据文件，位置由 `Path(__file__).with_name(...)` 决定——挪目录时必须跟着引擎走，否则 `presets()` 静默返回空、迁移测试静默跳过"}
