{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789818010.676922, "id": "693a017f4e97", "content": "端口确认了：**18060 无监听，服务当前没在跑**，所以实测做不了——但你的问题本身答案是确定的，而且这轮会话里已经有过机器验证。\n\n## 直答：可以。MCP 服务的本体就是一个 HTTP JSON-RPC 端点\n\n没有魔法。Clutch 内置那 135 行客户端做的事，就是下面三条 curl——这也是“其他手段”的完整配方：\n\n```bash\n# 1. initialize —— 拿会话（响应头里有 Mcp-Session-Id）\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:18060/mcp \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' -D - \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"initialize\",\"params\":{\"protocolVersion\":\"2025-03-26\",\"capabilities\":{},\"clientInfo\":{\"name\":\"cli\",\"version\":\"0\"}}}'\n\n# 2. initialized 通知（带上 1 拿到的会话 id）\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:18060/mcp -H 'Mcp-Session-Id: <sess>' \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"notifications/initialized\"}'\n\n# 3. tools/call —— 真正的搜索（中文参数用 \\uXXXX 转义，绕开 Windows GBK 乱码）\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:18060/mcp -H 'Mcp-Session-Id: <sess>' \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\n       \"params\":{\"name\":\"search_feeds\",\"arguments\":{\"keyword\":\"\\u5496\\u5561\",\"limit\":3}}}'\n```\n\n两个补充：\n\n- **很多服务器是无状态模式**——跳过第 1、2 步直接 `tools/call` 就行；试一下就知道这个服务吃不吃这套\n- **“其他手段”里 stdio 更直接**：把服务器进程拉起来，往 stdin 写 JSON-RPC 行、读 stdout 即可；还有现成桥接器（mcp-proxy、supergateway）能把任意 stdio 服务器变成上面的 HTTP 形态\n\n机器验证：本会话跑过的 `tests.mcpbackend_test` 里，`test_rpc_client` 就是对着一个**真实 loopback HTTP 服务器**走完 initialize → session → tools/call（含 SSE 帧、错误路径）的——59 项检查全过。协议层面“命令行能通”已经是既证事实，缺的只是对 18060 这个实例的实测。\n\n## 真正的本质：Clutch 有 shell，所以它自带万能客户端\n\n这才是你这个问题挖出来的核心事实：\n\n> **MCP 的目标客户，是没有代码执行能力的宿主**（Claude Desktop 聊天窗——它不能 curl，所以需要内置客户端替它说话）。**Clutch 的 agent 手里有 `run_command`，它自己就是那个客户端**——不需要谁替它集成。\n\n由此推出两个架构事实：\n\n1. **“其他手段”不仅可行，而且比 MCP 集成更通用**——curl/python 能打任何 HTTP API，不限于过了四道闸门的 MCP 子集。上一轮列的边界问题（stdio、鉴权、tools/list）在这条路上**不存在**\n2. **载荷直接进上下文完全没问题**——模型就是解释器，这正是 MCP 自己的默认读者模式（前面分层讨论的结论）。映射引擎只有“要把结果合并进统一搜索链”时才需要\n\n## 所以“MCP 不是好方案”这个判断，要拆成两半\n\n| | shell + 一页配方（skill） | 内置 MCP 客户端（现状） |\n|---|---|---|\n| 协议代码 | **0 行** | ~135 行 + 四道闸门的边界债 |\n| 端点/工具名/参数 | 写死在 SKILL.md 里，手写一次 | 操作者每次配置手填 record |\n| 结果消费 | 原文进上下文，模型直接读 | 映射成 `{title,url,snippet}` 并入 web_search 链 |\n| 与 bing/ddg 合并排名 | ❌ 独立调用 | ✅ 自动进后端链 |\n| 设置 UI / 状态点 | ❌ | ✅ |\n| 能对 spoken 范围 | **任何 HTTP API / 任何 stdio 进程** | 仅 MCP 服务器（且是窄子集） |\n\n**结论**：\n\n- 如果需求是“**agent 能搜小红书**”——你说得对，MCP 层是多余的。最简方案是写一个 `agent/skills/xhs-search/SKILL.md`：端点、工具名、参数、现成 curl 配方、回复形状一页说完，agent 相关时 `load_skill` 然后用 shell 干活。**零协议代码，复用仓库里已有的 skill 机制**，还能顺手写上“服务没起就提示操作者启动”\n- 如果需求是“**小红书结果自动和 bing/ddg 合并进 web_search**”——那某种声明式层仍是必需的，现有 MCP 层已是其中最省的实现；但即便如此，MCP 信封也只是可选管道， record 里真正干活的是映射引擎\n\n要不要我把它做出来？切到工作模式可以二选一（或都做）：① 写这个 skill（几分钟，零协议代码的路线落地）；② 等你把 18060 的服务起起来，我用 curl 实测一遍三条命令，把真实响应形状记进 skill 里。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "No output — port 18060 has no listener. The xiaohongshu MCP service is not currently running. So I can't do a live demo against it right now. But I can still demonstrate the principle — I have a working MCP server implementation in the test suite (tests/mcpbackend_test.py spins up a scripted loopback server). But starting that server requires running a process that keeps running — can't do easily in chat mode (and python running a script is blocked as write-ish; also backgrounding processes is not read-only).\n\nAlternative: demonstrate the command-line recipe itself, which is the answer to the user's question. The recipe is what matters:\n\n```bash\n# 1. initialize — 拿会话\ncurl -s -X POST http://localhost:18060/mcp \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -H 'Accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \\\n  -D - \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"initialize\",\"params\":{\"protocolVersion\":\"2025-03-26\",\"capabilities\":{},\"clientInfo\":{\"name\":\"cli\",\"version\":\"0\"}}}'\n# 响应头里有 Mcp-Session-Id\n\n# 2. initialized 通知\ncurl -s -X POST .../mcp -H 'Mcp-Session-Id: <sess>' \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"notifications/initialized\"}'\n\n# 3. tools/call — 真正的搜索\ncurl -s -X POST .../mcp -H 'Mcp-Session-Id: <sess>' \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":2,\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"search_feeds\",\"arguments\":{\"keyword\":\"咖啡\",\"limit\":3}}}'\n```\n\nAnd python one-liner version. And note: many servers in stateless mode skip steps 1-2 entirely — direct tools/call works. Worth testing against the real server when it's up.\n\nAnd: I verified earlier in this session (before compaction? no — in THIS session I ran the test suite which includes a real loopback MCP server speaking exactly these frames — test_rpc_client passes: initialize→session→tools/call with SSE and JSON). So the protocol-level claim is already empirically verified in this session by tests.mcpbackend_test — the JSON-RPC client against a real HTTP loopback server, 59 checks.\n\nNow the essence analysis. The user's question has a strategic layer: \"MCP 就不是一个好的解决方案\" + \"通过命令行或其他手段可以通信吗\" → implying: if the agent can just curl it, why does Clutch need an MCP client layer at all?\n\nKey insight (this is the crown of this whole conversation arc):\n\n**Clutch's agent HAS a shell (run_command). A agent with shell access is itself a universal MCP client — or rather, doesn't need to be an \"MCP client\" at all.** MCP's target customers are hosts WITHOUT code execution (Claude Desktop chat window). For Clutch:\n\n1. The service is reachable via plain HTTP JSON-RPC — curl/python three commands, zero integration code, agent improvises.\n2. Raw payload into context is FINE — the model is the universal interpreter (MCP's own default reader pattern, per the earlier layer analysis). No mapping engine needed for ad-hoc use.\n3. So what was the built-in MCP layer for? Only ONE thing: merging uniform {title,url,snippet} rows into the web_search backend chain (plus status UI + zero-footprint gating). If you drop the \"join the search chain\" requirement, the whole MCP layer (and all its boundary problems from the last discussions — stdio/auth/tools-list) evaporates.\n\nThe architectural alternative that captures the essence: **a skill instead of a protocol layer**. Write `agent/skills/xhs-search/SKILL.md` documenting: endpoint, tool name, arg names, a ready curl/python recipe, how to read the reply shape. The agent loads it when relevant and uses its existing shell. Zero protocol code, zero config UI, uses the skill mechanism the repo already has (load_skill + catalog). This is exactly the \"命令行或其他手段\" path institutionalized.\n\nComparison table:\n\n| | shell + skill (配方) | 内置 MCP 客户端 (现状) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 协议代码 | 0 行 | ~135 行 |\n| 结果消费 | 原文进上下文, 模型读 (MCP 默认读者) | 映射成统一行, 并入 web_search 链 |\n| 发现/工具名 | 写死在 skill 文本里 (手写一次) | 操作者手填 record (每次配置) |\n| 配置 UI/状态点 | 无 | 有 |\n| 适用边界 | 任何 HTTP API, 不限于 MCP! | 仅过四道闸门的 MCP 服务器 |\n| 与 bing/ddg 合并 | 不合并, 独立调用 | 合并进后端链 |\n\nAnd the sharper point: the shell path is MORE general than MCP — it talks to ANY HTTP API (or stdio process: even easier, launch and pipe JSON-RPC lines), not just the four-gate MCP subset. The \"boundary\" problems from the previous answer don't exist on this path.\n\nWhen is the built-in layer still worth it? Only if: (a) you want xiaohongshu results to rank WITH bing/ddg results in web_search automatically, (b) non-technical operators configure services via UI without the agent needing to improvise, (c) you want status dots. If those don't matter, the honest simplification is: delete/keep-frozen the MCP layer, ship a skill.\n\nAlso mention: for stdio-based MCP servers the command line is even more direct — spawn the process, write JSON-RPC lines to stdin, read stdout. And bridge tools exist (mcp-proxy, supergateway) to turn any stdio server into the HTTP form.\n\nStructure of my answer:\n1. 直答: 可以, 本质就是 HTTP JSON-RPC; 当前服务没起 (端口 18060 无监听, 我探测了), 但配方如下; 且本会话里 tests.mcpbackend_test 已经对着真实 loopback 服务器验证过同一套帧 (59 项检查).\n2. 三条 curl 配方 (+ 注意 CJK 参数用 \\u 转义绕 GBK; 无状态服务器常可跳过 1-2 步直接 tools/call).\n3. 本质洞察: Clutch 有 shell → 自带万能客户端. MCP 的目标客户是没有代码执行的宿主. \"其他手段\"不仅可行, 而且比 MCP 集成更通用 (任何 HTTP API, 不止四道闸门子集).\n4. 架构选择表: skill 配方 vs 内置 MCP 层 — 各自买到什么.\n5. 结论/建议: 如果需求只是\"agent 能搜小红书\", 删繁就简 = 写个 skill (0 行协议代码, 用已有的 load_skill 机制), 内置 MCP 层可以留作\"并入搜索链\"的选项或干脆冻结. 如果要并入 web_search 统一链, 现有层仍是最省的.\n6. 提议: 切工作模式可以把这个 skill 写出来 (几分钟), 或做个对照实验 (起服务后 curl 实测).\n\nWait — one more consideration on \"其他手段\": Python urllib one-liner (the test does exactly this). And raw tools/call without handshake for stateless-mode servers. Both worth showing compactly.\n\nAlso the empirical note: this session's test run (59 checks) included `test_rpc_client` — a REAL loopback HTTP server speaking initialize/initialized/tools/call + SSE framing — passed. So \"命令行/脚本可以和 MCP 服务通信\"已经在本会话被机器验证过, 只差对 18060 那个具体实例的实测 (它现在没起).\n\nKeep the answer focused and punchy. No more tool calls needed after this."}
