{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789870584.080109, "id": "4bce3dc1fbdb", "content": "下面是完整的改动清单。先给总览，再逐条给细节（每条包含：这个文件是干什么的 → 改哪里 → 改成什么样）。项目里代码内文本一律英文，下面骨架里的注释也按这个惯例写英文。\n\n## 总览\n\n| # | 文件 | 现在是干什么的 | 改动类型 |\n|---|------|--------------|---------|\n| 1 | `agent/tools/cli.py` | 不存在 | **新建**：子进程入口 |\n| 2 | `agent/tools/registry.py` | 工具注册表：一份 `Tool` 定义同时生成给模型的 JSON Schema 和本地执行入口；`execute()` 是全项目唯一真正调用工具函数的地方 | 修改 3 处 |\n| 3 | `agent/tools/workspace.py` | 工作区抽象：路径解析、文件读写、受保护文件名单 | 加 1 个 3 行的方法 |\n| 4 | `tests/toolcli_test.py` | 不存在 | **新建**：自运行测试 |\n| 5 | `agent/tools/filesystem.py` 等 10 个工具实现文件 | 各工具的实际逻辑 | **零改动** |\n\n`agent/loop.py`（主循环）、`agent/base.py`（装配）、`agent/core/permission.py`（权限门）**都不改**，原因见最后一节。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 新建 `agent/tools/cli.py`\n\n**作用**：一个独立进程的入口。父进程把“工具名 + 参数”以 JSON 写进它的 stdin，它调用和现在完全相同的工具函数，把返回的 `{content, error, diff}` 字典以 JSON 打到 stdout。参数走 stdin 而不是命令行，是因为 Windows 命令行有 32K 长度上限、且默认 GBK 编码会弄坏中文——这两点本会话都实测踩过。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Subprocess entry point for tool execution.\n\nParent: registry.execute -> spawn [sys.executable, -m agent.tools.cli]\nChild:  read one JSON object from stdin, call the same tool function the\n        registry would call, print its {content, error, diff} dict as JSON\n        on stdout.\n\nstdin payload:\n    {\"name\": str, \"args\": dict, \"workspace_root\": str,\n     \"mode\": str, \"read_max_chars\": int, \"protected\": [str, ...]}\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom ..config import Config\nfrom .registry import build_default_tools\nfrom .workspace import LocalWorkspace\n\n\ndef _run(payload: dict) -> dict:\n    name = payload[\"name\"]\n    config = Config(\n        mode=payload.get(\"mode\", \"work\"),\n        read_max_chars=payload.get(\"read_max_chars\", 20000),\n    )\n    workspace = LocalWorkspace(payload[\"workspace_root\"])\n    # re-apply the protected-path list: protection lives in a parent-side\n    # in-memory set and a fresh Workspace does not have it\n    for p in payload.get(\"protected\", []):\n        workspace.protect(Path(p))\n    tool = {t.name: t for t in build_default_tools(config)}.get(name)\n    if tool is None:\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: unknown tool {name!r}\", \"error\": True}\n    return tool.func(workspace, config, **payload.get(\"args\", {}))\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    # Chinese paths/content must survive the pipe on a GBK Windows console\n    sys.stdin.reconfigure(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    sys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    try:\n        result = _run(json.loads(sys.stdin.read()))\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 -- report to the parent as data\n        result = {\"content\": f\"ERROR: cli crashed: {e}\", \"error\": True}\n    json.dump(result, sys.stdout, ensure_ascii=False)\n    sys.stdout.flush()\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n```\n\n说明两点：\n- 子进程里用 `build_default_tools` 拿 name→函数的对应关系，而不是另抄一张表——避免同一映射存两份以后改不同步。代价是会白渲染一遍工具描述（读几个 `.md`），无害。\n- `build_default_tools(config)` 在 `memories=None` 时不含 `save_memory`/`load_memory`/`search_memory`（它们是闭包，绑定了父进程里的 MemoryStore 对象）。**这三个工具不加 subprocess 标记、不迁移**，其余工具想迁哪个迁哪个。\n\n## 2. 修改 `agent/tools/registry.py`（3 处）\n\n**改动 2.1 — `Tool` 定义加一个字段（L26-31）**：\n\n```python\n@dataclass\nclass Tool:\n    name: str\n    description: str\n    parameters: dict[str, Any]\n    func: ToolImpl\n    subprocess: bool = False  # True = run func in a child process via tools/cli.py\n```\n\n默认 `False`，即现状不变，逐个工具迁移。\n\n**改动 2.2 — `execute()` 加分支（方法体在约 L337 起，`result = tool.func(...)` 在 L353-355）**：\n\n```python\n        try:\n            args = self._coerce_types(tool, args)\n            if tool.subprocess:\n                result = self._exec_subprocess(workspace, config, name, args, cancel)\n            elif self._cancelable.get(name):\n                result = tool.func(workspace, config, cancel=cancel, **args)\n            else:\n                result = tool.func(workspace, config, **args)\n```\n\n**改动 2.3 — `ToolRegistry` 新增私有方法 `_exec_subprocess`**。要点：\n\n- 载荷序列化：`workspace.root`、`config.mode`、`config.read_max_chars`、受保护路径列表（来自下面第 3 条的新方法）。将来某个工具函数真用到 `Config` 的其他字段时，往载荷里加那个字段即可。\n- 启动：`subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"], cwd=仓库根)`。`sys.executable` 保证父子是同一个解释器；`-m` 方式要求仓库根可被导入，`cwd=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]`（即 `agent/tools/` 往上两级）就满足。\n- 防死锁：照抄本仓库现成的模式——`transport.py` L62 的 `_drain(pipe, sink)` 起两个读线程收 stdout/stderr，主线程写完 stdin 再等进程，避免“子进程写满管道、父进程卡在写 stdin”。\n- 取消与超时：主线程 `proc.wait(0.1)` 循环，每圈先查 `cancel`，再查超时（`config.command_timeout`，现值 30s）；任一触发就调 `transport.py` L76 的现成 `_kill_tree(proc)`——它已经处理了 Windows 下 `taskkill /T` 杀整棵进程树、POSIX 下杀进程组，不用重写。\n- 出口：stdout 按 UTF-8 拼 bytes 后 `json.loads`；解析失败（子进程 import 就崩了等）则把 stderr 尾部 2000 字符放进 `{\"content\": ..., \"error\": True}` 返回。`execute()` 末尾现成的 `setdefault(\"error\", False)` / `setdefault(\"diff\", \"\")` 会补齐缺的键，返回值形状对上层完全不变。\n\n```python\n    def _exec_subprocess(\n        self, workspace: Workspace, config: Config, name: str, args: dict[str, Any],\n        cancel: threading.Event | None,\n    ) -> dict[str, Any]:\n        payload = json.dumps(\n            {\n                \"name\": name,\n                \"args\": args,\n                \"workspace_root\": str(workspace.root),\n                \"mode\": config.mode,\n                \"read_max_chars\": config.read_max_chars,\n                \"protected\": [str(p) for p in workspace.protected()],\n            },\n            ensure_ascii=False,\n        ).encode(\"utf-8\")\n        repo_root = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"],\n            cwd=str(repo_root),\n            stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n            stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n            stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n        )\n        out: list[bytes] = []\n        err: list[bytes] = []\n        readers = [\n            threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stdout, out), daemon=True),\n            threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stderr, err), daemon=True),\n        ]\n        for t in readers:\n            t.start()\n        try:\n            proc.stdin.write(payload)\n            proc.stdin.close()\n        except OSError:\n            pass  # child died early; its stderr surfaces below\n        deadline = time.monotonic() + config.command_timeout\n        code = None\n        while True:\n            if cancel is not None and cancel.is_set():\n                _kill_tree(proc)\n                return {\"content\": \"ERROR: tool call canceled\", \"error\": True}\n            try:\n                code = proc.wait(timeout=0.1)\n                break\n            except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n                if time.monotonic() > deadline:\n                    _kill_tree(proc)\n                    return {\n                        \"content\": f\"ERROR: tool timed out after {config.command_timeout}s\",\n                        \"error\": True,\n                    }\n        for t in readers:\n            t.join(timeout=5)\n        try:\n            return json.loads(b\"\".join(out).decode(\"utf-8\"))\n        except (ValueError, UnicodeDecodeError):\n            tail = b\"\".join(err).decode(\"utf-8\", \"replace\")[-2000:]\n            return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: tool subprocess crashed (exit {code}): {tail}\", \"error\": True}\n```\n\n（`json`、`subprocess`、`sys`、`time`、`Path`、`_drain`、`_kill_tree` 相应在文件头导入；`_drain`/`_kill_tree` 从 `.transport` 导入。）\n\n`__init__` 里现有的 `self._cancelable`（用 `inspect.signature` 看 func 有没有 `cancel` 参数）**不用动**：func 字段还在，subprocess 工具的 cancel 由上面这个方法自己消费。\n\n## 3. `agent/tools/workspace.py`：加 1 个方法（L147 `protect` 旁边）\n\n**作用**：`protect()` 把 `.clc` 项目文件记进一个内存集合，`read_file`/`write_file` 都会拒绝碰这些路径。子进程重建 Workspace 后这个集合是空的——不补这一条，子进程里 read_file 就能读到父进程本来禁止读的 `.clc`，是个真实的行为差异。\n\n```python\n    def protected(self) -> set[Path]:\n        \"\"\"Snapshot of protected paths (the subprocess CLI re-applies them).\"\"\"\n        return set(self._protected)\n```\n\n## 4. 试点迁移：`registry.py` 的 read_file 定义处（L56 起）\n\n`filesystem.py` 本身**零改动**。只在 `build_default_tools` 里 read_file 那个 `Tool(...)` 调用上加一个参数：\n\n```python\n        Tool(\n            name=\"read_file\",\n            ...\n            func=lambda sb, cfg, **kw: filesystem.read_file(sb, cfg, **kw),\n            subprocess=True,\n        ),\n```\n\n跑通、测试全绿后，其他工具照这个样子逐个加，或者不加就维持原状——两条路径共存。\n\n## 5. 新建 `tests/toolcli_test.py`\n\n**作用**：项目测试都是 `python -m tests.X` 形式的自运行模块。用例：\n\n1. **CLI 直连**：临时目录放一个含中文内容的文件，`subprocess.run([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"], input=payload_bytes)`，断言 stdout JSON 的 `content` 与文件内容一致、`error` 为 False（编码回归）。\n2. **错误路径**：读不存在的文件，断言 `error: true` 且 content 含错误文本。\n3. **未知工具**：喂一个不存在的名字，断言 stdout 仍是可解析 JSON（而不是崩掉）。\n4. **注册表分支一致性**：构造 `ToolRegistry(build_default_tools(cfg))`，把 read_file 的 `subprocess` 置 True，同一批参数分别走子进程分支和原 func 直调，断言两个返回 dict 相等。\n5. **取消**：把 run_command 的 `subprocess` 置 True，worker 线程里 `execute(name=\"run_command\", args={\"command\": \"sleep 30\"})`，主线程 0.5 秒后 set cancel，join 后断言总耗时 < 10 秒、返回 `error: true`（验证杀的是整棵树：CLI 进程和它派生的 bash）。\n\n## 6. 回归验证\n\n```\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.toolcli_test\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.local_shell_test\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.selfcheck\n```\n\n`local_shell_test` 必须全绿是因为改动 2.3 复用了 `transport.py` 的 `_drain`/`_kill_tree`，要证明只是复用、没改它们。\n\n---\n\n## 明确不改的文件，及原因\n\n| 文件 | 为什么不用改 |\n|------|------------|\n| `agent/loop.py` | `_execute_tool`（L277）的顺序是：解析参数 → `gate.require`（L284-288，权限检查）→ `registry.execute`（L292）。事件流（tool_call_start/delta/end）、doom-loop 检测都发生在 `registry.execute` 之前/之外的父进程里。`execute` 的签名和返回形状没变，这层全透明。 |\n| `agent/base.py` | `build_tools`（L149）只是把 `build_default_tools` 的列表装进 `ToolRegistry`，列表形状没变。 |\n| `agent/core/permission.py` | 审批发生在工具执行之前，跟工具在哪个进程里跑无关。 |\n| `agent/tools/filesystem.py` | 函数体不动，只是调用地点从父进程换到子进程。 |\n| 其余 9 个工具的实现 | 不加 `subprocess=True` 就完全走原路径。 |\n\n一个已知代价，说清楚：每个 `subprocess=True` 的调用多付一次解释器启动，Windows 上约 0.1–0.3 秒。第一版接受它；将来嫌慢再做常驻子进程，那是另一个改动，不在本清单内。\n\n---\n\n落地这些改动需要写文件，当前是 chat 模式（只读）。你切换到 work mode 后我就按上面 1→6 的顺序实施。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Confirmed: `protect` adds to an in-memory set `self._protected`. The subprocess's fresh Workspace won't have it, so read_file's `is_protected` check would silently pass in the subprocess — the .clc project file could be read via read_file even though the parent refuses. Fix: payload carries `protected: [str, ...]` (the parent sends `workspace.protected_paths()` or just the paths); CLI calls `workspace.protect(...)` for each. There's no getter for _protected; the parent knows what it passed: in base.start_task it's `project.path`. But registry.execute doesn't have access to project... registry.execute has `workspace`. Options:\n1. Add a small getter on Workspace: `def protected(self) -> set[Path]: return set(self._protected)`.\n2. Parent (_exec_subprocess) reads `workspace.protected()` and puts in payload.\n\nThat's one extra 3-line method on Workspace. Concrete and clean. I'll include it as change item.\n\nAlso note `clear_allowed` — that's the permission escape grant, applied in loop, unrelated to subprocess.\n\nNow the timeout: `config.command_timeout` = 30s default. read_file could take longer on huge files? Reads are capped by read_max_chars... workspace.read reads whole file though (cat). A giant file could take >30s over ssh but locally fine. For the first migration keep `timeout = max(config.command_timeout, 60)`? Keep simple: use config.command_timeout as the subprocess timeout, note that a per-tool timeout can be added later if some tool needs longer (web tools use web_search_timeout=15 anyway < 30). Actually to not over-engineer: `_exec_subprocess` takes timeout from `config.command_timeout`; if a future migrated tool needs more, revisit. Good.\n\nstdout reading without deadlock: must read stdout/stderr concurrently with writing stdin (write_file content can be big — stdin write could block if child isn't reading; child reads all stdin first, so pipe buffer could fill if payload > 64KB... e.g. edit_file content 100KB → child reads continuously from stdin until EOF, so it does drain. But parent writing 100KB while child not yet reading? Child starts reading immediately at main(). Pipe buffer 64KB on Windows could block parent write until child consumes — child is consuming, fine. Deadlock risk: parent writes stdin fully → then reads stdout; child writes big stdout (>64KB, e.g. read_file 20000 chars ≈ fine, but grep content or future write_file diff...) while parent still writing stdin → child blocks writing stdout, parent blocks writing stdin = classic deadlock. Correct pattern: write stdin from a thread (or use communicate with input... but we need cancel-kill). Use a writer thread like LocalTransport's drain threads. Concrete: in _exec_subprocess, spawn a thread to write stdin + close, main thread poll-wait loop with cancel checks, then read stdout. Simpler correct approach: use proc.communicate(input=payload_bytes, timeout=...) in a loop? communicate can't be interrupted by cancel except via timeout thread. Standard approach: writer thread for stdin; main thread waits with `proc.wait(0.1)` loop checking cancel; after exit, `proc.stdout.read()`, `proc.stderr.read()`. Since stdout is only written by child and read by parent after child exits — if child's stdout > pipe buffer (64KB) the child blocks and never exits → deadlock again! read_file max 20000 chars + escapes — could exceed 64KB with multibyte? 20000 chars, CJK 3 bytes each = 60KB, plus JSON escaping (ensure_ascii=False keeps raw)... could approach 64KB but buffer 64KB+ on Windows anonymous pipes is actually 4KB-64KB variable; risky. Correct: reader threads for stdout/stderr like transport's `_drain` (it exists! `agent/tools/transport.py` L62 `_drain(pipe, sink)` — reuse it: start two drain threads at spawn, write stdin in main thread, then poll loop with cancel, then join drains). \n\nSo `_exec_subprocess` skeleton:\n\n```python\ndef _exec_subprocess(self, workspace, config, name, args, cancel):\n    from .transport import _drain, _kill_tree  # module-level import instead\n    payload = json.dumps(\n        {\n            \"name\": name,\n            \"args\": args,\n            \"workspace_root\": str(workspace.root),\n            \"mode\": config.mode,\n            \"read_max_chars\": config.read_max_chars,\n            \"protected\": [str(p) for p in workspace.protected()],\n        },\n        ensure_ascii=False,\n    ).encode(\"utf-8\")\n    repo_root = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n    proc = subprocess.Popen(\n        [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"],\n        cwd=str(repo_root),\n        stdin=subprocess.PIPE, stdout=subprocess.PIPE, stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n    )\n    out, err = [], []\n    readers = [threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stdout, out), daemon=True),\n               threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stderr, err), daemon=True)]\n    for t in readers: t.start()\n    try:\n        proc.stdin.write(payload)\n        proc.stdin.close()\n    except OSError:\n        pass  # child died early; the error surfaces below\n    deadline = time.monotonic() + config.command_timeout\n    while True:\n        if cancel is not None and cancel.is_set():\n            _kill_tree(proc)\n            return {\"content\": \"ERROR: tool call canceled\", \"error\": True}\n        try:\n            code = proc.wait(timeout=0.1)\n            break\n        except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n            if time.monotonic() > deadline:\n                _kill_tree(proc)\n                return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: tool timed out after {config.command_timeout}s\", \"error\": True}\n    for t in readers: t.join(timeout=5)\n    try:\n        return json.loads(b\"\".join(out).decode(\"utf-8\"))\n    except (ValueError, UnicodeDecodeError):\n        tail = b\"\".join(err).decode(\"utf-8\", \"replace\")[-2000:]\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: tool subprocess crashed (exit {code}): {tail}\", \"error\": True}\n```\n\nThat's concrete. JSON parse result may lack error/diff keys — the existing code at end of execute() does setdefault(\"error\", False)/setdefault(\"diff\", \"\") so fine.\n\nWait: `_drain` reads bytes with pipe in binary mode — Popen default is binary, good.\n\nOne subtlety: cli.py writes result even on crash inside _run — but if the CLI itself dies at import (ImportError), stdout empty, stderr has traceback → the fallback branch covers it. Good.\n\nProtected getter addition on Workspace (L147 area):\n\n```python\ndef protected(self) -> set[Path]:\n    \"\"\"Paths marked invisible (the subprocess CLI re-applies them).\"\"\"\n    return set(self._protected)\n```\n\nAnd CLI re-applies:\n```python\nfor p in payload.get(\"protected\", []):\n    workspace.protect(Path(p))\n```\nprotect takes Path (self.realpath(path)); signature `protect(self, path: Path)`.\n\nMemory tools: CLI builds build_default_tools(config) with memories=None → save_memory/load_memory/search_memory missing → CLI returns unknown tool. State: these 3 don't migrate (they're closures over MemoryStore, no subprocess field). Fine since migration is opt-in per tool.\n\nSkill tool `load_skill` uses config.skills_dir — default Path(__file__)/skills works in subprocess. Not migrating it anyway.\n\nNow `sys.executable` — parent runs under .venv python; subprocess inherits same interpreter. Repo root: `Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]` from agent/tools/registry.py: parents[0]=agent/tools, parents[1]=agent, parents[2]=Clutch root. Correct.\n\nTest file sketch:\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Self-running tests for the tool-execution CLI (agent/tools/cli.py).\"\"\"\n```\nCases:\n1. `test_read_file_roundtrip`: tmp dir + file with Chinese content; run subprocess `python -m agent.tools.cli` with payload; assert content matches.\n2. `test_missing_file_error`: assert error true.\n3. `test_registry_branch`: ToolRegistry with read_file Tool(subprocess=True) + one normal tool; execute both; results equal to direct func call.\n4. `test_cancel_kills_subprocess`: execute run_command via subprocess branch with command \"sleep 30\", cancel after 0.5s in main thread — run execute in a worker thread, set cancel, join; assert elapsed < 10s and error True.\n\nHmm wait — run_command via CLI: run_command is `func=lambda sb, cfg, cancel=None, **kw: shell.run_command(...)` — CLI calls `tool.func(workspace, config, **args)` — cancel not passed, defaults None. Fine, CLI-side cancel isn't needed (parent kills the tree). But run_command in CLI spawns bash -c sleep 30 as ITS child; parent taskkill /T kills CLI + bash tree. Good. But run_command has blocked_prefixes etc. — \"sleep 30\" fine. Note in chat mode build_default_tools run_command exists too. But CLI's build uses mode from payload; test passes mode=\"work\".\n\nActually simpler cancel test avoiding nested shells: use grep on a huge tree? Non-deterministic. Keep run_command sleep 30. On Windows Git Bash `sleep 30` exists. OK.\n\n5. `test_unknown_tool`: CLI stdout JSON parseable with error content.\n\nAlso test 3 needs ToolRegistry(build_default_tools(...)) then mutate: `tools = build_default_tools(cfg); tools[0].subprocess = True`. Fine.\n\nRegression commands.\n\nNow — file list with one-line role explanation. Also mention that `execute()` signature/return shape unchanged so loop.py doesn't change. And mention PermissionGate stays in parent (loop L284-288) — permission decisions + events + doom-loop detection never enter the subprocess.\n\nOne more: `build_default_tools(config)` inside CLI renders descriptions (reads prompts/*.md) — harmless; keep single source of truth for name→func mapping (no second table to maintain). One sentence, factual.\n\nCost note: one interpreter startup per subprocess-tool call (~0.1–0.3 s on Windows). Factual, one line.\n\nAlso note in plan: files NOT changed: loop.py, base.py, permission, filesystem.py (read_file body), shell.py, workspace.py — EXCEPT workspace.py gets one tiny getter (protected()). Be honest: workspace.py IS touched (3 lines). Correct the earlier \"only one cut point\" claim accordingly.\n\nFormat: \n- 开头一句：改动一共 X 处，按实施顺序列。\n- 表格总览\n- 每处详情 with code blocks\n- 不改的文件与原因\n- 测试与验证\n- 一句：需要 work mode 才能落地。\n\nKeep it plain, no meta-commentary. Use Chinese. Headers in Chinese. Cite exact line numbers where I have them: registry.py Tool dataclass L26-31; execute 约 L337（func 调用在 L353-355）; build_default_tools L52; read_file Tool 定义 L56-85; filesystem.read_file L21; loop.py _execute_tool L277, gate L284-288; base.py build_tools L149; transport.py _kill_tree L76, _drain L62; workspace.py protect L147.\n\nLength: detailed but no fluff."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1789870584.0831125, "id": "79cfb0925cd4", "status": "completed", "summary": "下面是完整的改动清单。先给总览，再逐条给细节（每条包含：这个文件是干什么的 → 改哪里 → 改成什么样）。项目里代码内文本一律英文，下面骨架里的注释也按这个惯例写英文。\n\n## 总览\n\n| # | 文件 | 现在是干什么的 | 改动类型 |\n|---|------|--------------|---------|\n| 1 | `agent/tools/cli.py` | 不存在 | **新建**：子进程入口 |\n| 2 | `agent/tools/registry.py` | 工具注册表：一份 `Tool` 定义同时生成给模型的 JSON Schema 和本地执行入口；`execute()` 是全项目唯一真正调用工具函数的地方 | 修改 3 处 |\n| 3 | `agent/tools/workspace.py` | 工作区抽象：路径解析、文件读写、受保护文件名单 | 加 1 个 3 行的方法 |\n| 4 | `tests/toolcli_test.py` | 不存在 | **新建**：自运行测试 |\n| 5 | `agent/tools/filesystem.py` 等 10 个工具实现文件 | 各工具的实际逻辑 | **零改动** |\n\n`agent/loop.py`（主循环）、`agent/base.py`（装配）、`agent/core/permission.py`（权限门）**都不改**，原因见最后一节。\n\n---\n\n## 1. 新建 `agent/tools/cli.py`\n\n**作用**：一个独立进程的入口。父进程把“工具名 + 参数”以 JSON 写进它的 stdin，它调用和现在完全相同的工具函数，把返回的 `{content, error, diff}` 字典以 JSON 打到 stdout。参数走 stdin 而不是命令行，是因为 Windows 命令行有 32K 长度上限、且默认 GBK 编码会弄坏中文——这两点本会话都实测踩过。\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Subprocess entry point for tool execution.\n\nParent: registry.execute -> spawn [sys.executable, -m agent.tools.cli]\nChild:  read one JSON object from stdin, call the same tool function the\n        registry would call, print its {content, error, diff} dict as JSON\n        on stdout.\n\nstdin payload:\n    {\"name\": str, \"args\": dict, \"workspace_root\": str,\n     \"mode\": str, \"read_max_chars\": int, \"protected\": [str, ...]}\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom ..config import Config\nfrom .registry import build_default_tools\nfrom .workspace import LocalWorkspace\n\n\ndef _run(payload: dict) -> dict:\n    name = payload[\"name\"]\n    config = Config(\n        mode=payload.get(\"mode\", \"work\"),\n        read_max_chars=payload.get(\"read_max_chars\", 20000),\n    )\n    workspace = LocalWorkspace(payload[\"workspace_root\"])\n    # re-apply the protected-path list: protection lives in a parent-side\n    # in-memory set and a fresh Workspace does not have it\n    for p in payload.get(\"protected\", []):\n        workspace.protect(Path(p))\n    tool = {t.name: t for t in build_default_tools(config)}.get(name)\n    if tool is None:\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: unknown tool {name!r}\", \"error\": True}\n    return tool.func(workspace, config, **payload.get(\"args\", {}))\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    # Chinese paths/content must survive the pipe on a GBK Windows console\n    sys.stdin.reconfigure(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    sys.stdout.reconfigure(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    try:\n        result = _run(json.loads(sys.stdin.read()))\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 -- report to the parent as data\n        result = {\"content\": f\"ERROR: cli crashed: {e}\", \"error\": True}\n    json.dump(result, sys.stdout, ensure_ascii=False)\n    sys.stdout.flush()\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n```\n\n说明两点：\n- 子进程里用 `build_default_tools` 拿 name→函数的对应关系，而不是另抄一张表——避免同一映射存两份以后改不同步。代价是会白渲染一遍工具描述（读几个 `.md`），无害。\n- `build_default_tools(config)` 在 `memories=None` 时不含 `save_memory`/`load_memory`/`search_memory`（它们是闭包，绑定了父进程里的 MemoryStore 对象）。**这三个工具不加 subprocess 标记、不迁移**，其余工具想迁哪个迁哪个。\n\n## 2. 修改 `agent/tools/registry.py`（3 处）\n\n**改动 2.1 — `Tool` 定义加一个字段（L26-31）**：\n\n```python\n@dataclass\nclass Tool:\n    name: str\n    description: str\n    parameters: dict[str, Any]\n    func: ToolImpl\n    subprocess: bool = False  # True = run func in a child process via tools/cli.py\n```\n\n默认 `False`，即现状不变，逐个工具迁移。\n\n**改动 2.2 — `execute()` 加分支（方法体在约 L337 起，`result = tool.func(...)` 在 L353-355）**：\n\n```python\n        try:\n            args = self._coerce_types(tool, args)\n            if tool.subprocess:\n                result = self._exec_subprocess(workspace, config, name, args, cancel)\n            elif self._cancelable.get(name):\n                result = tool.func(workspace, config, cancel=cancel, **args)\n            else:\n                result = tool.func(workspace, config, **args)\n```\n\n**改动 2.3 — `ToolRegistry` 新增私有方法 `_exec_subprocess`**。要点：\n\n- 载荷序列化：`workspace.root`、`config.mode`、`config.read_max_chars`、受保护路径列表（来自下面第 3 条的新方法）。将来某个工具函数真用到 `Config` 的其他字段时，往载荷里加那个字段即可。\n- 启动：`subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"], cwd=仓库根)`。`sys.executable` 保证父子是同一个解释器；`-m` 方式要求仓库根可被导入，`cwd=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]`（即 `agent/tools/` 往上两级）就满足。\n- 防死锁：照抄本仓库现成的模式——`transport.py` L62 的 `_drain(pipe, sink)` 起两个读线程收 stdout/stderr，主线程写完 stdin 再等进程，避免“子进程写满管道、父进程卡在写 stdin”。\n- 取消与超时：主线程 `proc.wait(0.1)` 循环，每圈先查 `cancel`，再查超时（`config.command_timeout`，现值 30s）；任一触发就调 `transport.py` L76 的现成 `_kill_tree(proc)`——它已经处理了 Windows 下 `taskkill /T` 杀整棵进程树、POSIX 下杀进程组，不用重写。\n- 出口：stdout 按 UTF-8 拼 bytes 后 `json.loads`；解析失败（子进程 import 就崩了等）则把 stderr 尾部 2000 字符放进 `{\"content\": ..., \"error\": True}` 返回。`execute()` 末尾现成的 `setdefault(\"error\", False)` / `setdefault(\"diff\", \"\")` 会补齐缺的键，返回值形状对上层完全不变。\n\n```python\n    def _exec_subprocess(\n        self, workspace: Workspace, config: Config, name: str, args: dict[str, Any],\n        cancel: threading.Event | None,\n    ) -> dict[str, Any]:\n        payload = json.dumps(\n            {\n                \"name\": name,\n                \"args\": args,\n                \"workspace_root\": str(workspace.root),\n                \"mode\": config.mode,\n                \"read_max_chars\": config.read_max_chars,\n                \"protected\": [str(p) for p in workspace.protected()],\n            },\n            ensure_ascii=False,\n        ).encode(\"utf-8\")\n        repo_root = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n        proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"],\n            cwd=str(repo_root),\n            stdin=subprocess.PIPE,\n            stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n            stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n        )\n        out: list[bytes] = []\n        err: list[bytes] = []\n        readers = [\n            threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stdout, out), daemon=True),\n            threading.Thread(target=_drain, args=(proc.stderr, err), daemon=True),\n        ]\n        for t in readers:\n            t.start()\n        try:\n            proc.stdin.write(payload)\n            proc.stdin.close()\n        except OSError:\n            pass  # child died early; its stderr surfaces below\n        deadline = time.monotonic() + config.command_timeout\n        code = None\n        while True:\n            if cancel is not None and cancel.is_set():\n                _kill_tree(proc)\n                return {\"content\": \"ERROR: tool call canceled\", \"error\": True}\n            try:\n                code = proc.wait(timeout=0.1)\n                break\n            except subprocess.TimeoutExpired:\n                if time.monotonic() > deadline:\n                    _kill_tree(proc)\n                    return {\n                        \"content\": f\"ERROR: tool timed out after {config.command_timeout}s\",\n                        \"error\": True,\n                    }\n        for t in readers:\n            t.join(timeout=5)\n        try:\n            return json.loads(b\"\".join(out).decode(\"utf-8\"))\n        except (ValueError, UnicodeDecodeError):\n            tail = b\"\".join(err).decode(\"utf-8\", \"replace\")[-2000:]\n            return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: tool subprocess crashed (exit {code}): {tail}\", \"error\": True}\n```\n\n（`json`、`subprocess`、`sys`、`time`、`Path`、`_drain`、`_kill_tree` 相应在文件头导入；`_drain`/`_kill_tree` 从 `.transport` 导入。）\n\n`__init__` 里现有的 `self._cancelable`（用 `inspect.signature` 看 func 有没有 `cancel` 参数）**不用动**：func 字段还在，subprocess 工具的 cancel 由上面这个方法自己消费。\n\n## 3. `agent/tools/workspace.py`：加 1 个方法（L147 `protect` 旁边）\n\n**作用**：`protect()` 把 `.clc` 项目文件记进一个内存集合，`read_file`/`write_file` 都会拒绝碰这些路径。子进程重建 Workspace 后这个集合是空的——不补这一条，子进程里 read_file 就能读到父进程本来禁止读的 `.clc`，是个真实的行为差异。\n\n```python\n    def protected(self) -> set[Path]:\n        \"\"\"Snapshot of protected paths (the subprocess CLI re-applies them).\"\"\"\n        return set(self._protected)\n```\n\n## 4. 试点迁移：`registry.py` 的 read_file 定义处（L56 起）\n\n`filesystem.py` 本身**零改动**。只在 `build_default_tools` 里 read_file 那个 `Tool(...)` 调用上加一个参数：\n\n```python\n        Tool(\n            name=\"read_file\",\n            ...\n            func=lambda sb, cfg, **kw: filesystem.read_file(sb, cfg, **kw),\n            subprocess=True,\n        ),\n```\n\n跑通、测试全绿后，其他工具照这个样子逐个加，或者不加就维持原状——两条路径共存。\n\n## 5. 新建 `tests/toolcli_test.py`\n\n**作用**：项目测试都是 `python -m tests.X` 形式的自运行模块。用例：\n\n1. **CLI 直连**：临时目录放一个含中文内容的文件，`subprocess.run([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"], input=payload_bytes)`，断言 stdout JSON 的 `content` 与文件内容一致、`error` 为 False（编码回归）。\n2. **错误路径**：读不存在的文件，断言 `error: true` 且 content 含错误文本。\n3. **未知工具**：喂一个不存在的名字，断言 stdout 仍是可解析 JSON（而不是崩掉）。\n4. **注册表分支一致性**：构造 `ToolRegistry(build_default_tools(cfg))`，把 read_file 的 `subprocess` 置 True，同一批参数分别走子进程分支和原 func 直调，断言两个返回 dict 相等。\n5. **取消**：把 run_command 的 `subprocess` 置 True，worker 线程里 `execute(name=\"run_command\", args={\"command\": \"sleep 30\"})`，主线程 0.5 秒后 set cancel，join 后断言总耗时 < 10 秒、返回 `error: true`（验证杀的是整棵树：CLI 进程和它派生的 bash）。\n\n## 6. 回归验证\n\n```\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.toolcli_test\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.local_shell_test\n.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m tests.selfcheck\n```\n\n`local_shell_test` 必须全绿是因为改动 2.3 复用了 `transport.py` 的 `_drain`/`_kill_tree`，要证明只是复用、没改它们。\n\n---\n\n## 明确不改的文件，及原因\n\n| 文件 | 为什么不用改 |\n|------|------------|\n| `agent/loop.py` | `_execute_tool`（L277）的顺序是：解析参数 → `gate.require`（L284-288，权限检查）→ `registry.execute`（L292）。事件流（tool_call_start/delta/end）、doom-loop 检测都发生在 `registry.execute` 之前/之外的父进程里。`execute` 的签名和返回形状没变，这层全透明。 |\n| `agent/base.py` | `build_tools`（L149）只是把 `build_default_tools` 的列表装进 `ToolRegistry`，列表形状没变。 |\n| `agent/core/permission.py` | 审批发生在工具执行之前，跟工具在哪个进程里跑无关。 |\n| `agent/tools/filesystem.py` | 函数体不动，只是调用地点从父进程换到子进程。 |\n| 其余 9 个工具的实现 | 不加 `subprocess=True` 就完全走原路径。 |\n\n一个已知代价，说清楚：每个 `subprocess=True` 的调用多付一次解释器启动，Windows 上约 0.1–0.3 秒。第一版接受它；将来嫌慢再做常驻子进程，那是另一个改动，不在本清单内。\n\n---\n\n落地这些改动需要写文件，当前是 chat 模式（只读）。你切换到 work mode 后我就按上面 1→6 的顺序实施。"}
