{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789872565.411477, "id": "52491c750b6e", "tool_call_id": "call_5246a13dc719435398816b60", "content": "OK: edited C:\\Users\\12741\\Desktop\\临时文件\\Clutch\\agent\\tools\\registry.py (+5 -0 lines)", "is_error": false, "diff": "--- a/agent\\tools\\registry.py\n+++ b/agent\\tools\\registry.py\n@@ -36,6 +36,11 @@\n     description: str\n     parameters: dict[str, Any]  # JSON Schema (properties + required)\n     func: ToolImpl\n+    # True = run func in a child process (tools/cli.py) instead of in-process;\n+    # opt-in per tool so migration is gradual. execute() ignores it for remote\n+    # workspaces (the child would hit the LOCAL disk) and under frozen builds\n+    # (sys.executable is the bundle, not python).\n+    subprocess: bool = False\n \n     def to_openai_schema(self) -> dict[str, Any]:\n         return {\n"}
