{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789872827.0874753, "id": "8728ff3ebcea", "content": "可以。现在有**两层**手动调用方式，我直接跑给你看。\n\n## 方式一：直连 CLI（绕过派发器，测子进程本身）\n\n一条命令，JSON 从 stdin 喂进去，stdout 出结果 JSON：\n\n```bash\necho '{\"name\": \"read_file\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"agent/tools/cli.py\", \"max_chars\": 160}, \"workspace_root\": \"C:/Users/12741/Desktop/临时文件/Clutch\", \"mode\": \"work\", \"read_max_chars\": 20000, \"protected\": []}' | .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m agent.tools.cli\n```\n\n要点：`workspace_root` 必须是绝对路径；`args.path` 相对它；`protected` 是绝对路径列表。实际跑：", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_2ddf1efffb3742c0b3910d6c", "name": "run_command", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"echo '{\\\"name\\\": \\\"read_file\\\", \\\"args\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"agent/tools/cli.py\\\", \\\"max_chars\\\": 160}, \\\"workspace_root\\\": \\\"C:/Users/12741/Desktop/临时文件/Clutch\\\", \\\"mode\\\": \\\"work\\\", \\\"read_max_chars\\\": 20000, \\\"protected\\\": []}' | .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m agent.tools.cli\"}"}], "reasoning": "The user asks: \"How can I test it? For example, can I now manually invoke read_file once with a command?\"\n\nThey want to manually exercise the new subprocess CLI path — call read_file by hand via a command. Let me give them the exact command(s), and actually demonstrate it live (I'm in work mode, I can run commands). The best answer: show the exact one-liner they can run themselves, plus run it for real to prove it works.\n\nThe CLI reads a JSON payload from stdin:\n\n```json\n{\"name\": \"read_file\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"agent/tools/cli.py\"}, \"workspace_root\": \"<abs path>\", \"mode\": \"work\", \"read_max_chars\": 20000, \"protected\": []}\n```\n\nCommand on Windows Git Bash:\n\n```bash\necho '{\"name\": \"read_file\", \"args\": {\"path\": \"README.md\"}, \"workspace_root\": \"C:/Users/12741/Desktop/临时文件/Clutch\", \"mode\": \"work\", \"read_max_chars\": 200, \"protected\": []}' | .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m agent.tools.cli\n```\n\nConcerns:\n- Chinese path in JSON via