己跑在本地还是远程。", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Confirmed: workspace.py wraps Transport (LocalWorkspace → LocalTransport, RemoteWorkspace → SshTransport) and uses localshell for shell detection.\n\nNow write the final answer with:\n1. 10 tools → implementing modules table\n2. agent/tools/ modules besides workspace — what each does\n3. layering mermaid diagram\n4. note: 4 memory/skill tools' real backends are agent/memory.py + agent/skills.py"}
