{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789877630.9886162, "id": "8450b9435e11", "tool_call_id": "call_e79b79247ee048c581bf45a1", "content": "agent\\core\\compaction.py:\n  Line 130:                 for tc in ev.tool_calls:\n\nagent\\core\\context.py:\n  Line 69:             if ev.tool_calls:\n  Line 70:                 msg[\"tool_calls\"] = [\n  Line 76:                     for tc in ev.tool_calls\n  Line 87:     Drop assistant tool_calls without their tool results, plus orphan tool\n  Line 94:         if m[\"role\"] == \"assistant\" and \"tool_calls\" in m:\n  Line 95:             ids = [tc[\"id\"] for tc in m[\"tool_calls\"]]\n  Line 104:                 # interrupted block: drop tool_calls; only real text can stand alone\n  Line 105:                 cleaned = {k: v for k, v in m.items() if k != \"tool_calls\"}\n  Line 112:             # no tool_calls: only a message with real text can stand alone\n\nagent\\core\\parse.py:\n  Line 6: - finish_reason classification: tool_calls -> execute; stop -> natural end; length -> truncated\n\nagent\\events.py:\n  Line 69:     tool_calls: list[dict[str, Any]] = field(default_factory=list)  # [{id,name,arguments}]\n\nagent\\llm\\llm_clients\\chunk_handle.py:\n  Line 45:         if not delta or not delta.tool_calls:\n  Line 49:         for tc in delta.tool_calls:\n  Line 93:         tool_calls = [\n  Line 101:                 \"tool_calls\": tool_calls,\n\nagent\\llm\\llm_clients\\openai_client.py:\n  Line 106:                         \"tool_calls\": [\n\nagent\\loop.py:\n  Line 7:    b. call LLM, parse (content, tool_calls, finish_reason)\n  Line 104:         Returns (content, tool_calls, finish_reason, reasoning). tool_calls\n  Line 113:             for ev in self.llm.stream(msgs, tools=self.registry.schemas()):\n  Line 149:                     tool_calls = [\n  Line 152:                     return content, tool_calls, finish_reason, \"\".join(reasoning_parts)\n  Line 188:                     content, tool_calls, finish_reason,