{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789877941.4715211, "id": "3be1a12e6fbb", "tool_call_id": "call_c07ce338a93a48e9ac520254", "content": "\"\"\"Subprocess entry point for tool execution.\n\nParent: registry.execute -> spawn [sys.executable, \"-m\", \"agent.tools.cli\"].\nChild:  read ONE JSON object from stdin, call the same tool function the\nregistry would call in-process, print its {content, error, diff} dict as a\nJSON object on stdout. The exit code stays 0 whenever a result was produced —\nthe parent trusts the JSON, not the code; a non-zero exit only marks a crash\nbefore any JSON, which the parent reports from stderr.\n\nstdin payload:\n    {\"name\": str, \"args\": dict, \"workspace_root\": str,\n     \"mode\": str, \"read_max_chars\": int, \"protected\": [str, ...]}\n\nPlatform notes: no shell is involved anywhere; the parent keeps its pipes\nBINARY (text mode would translate newlines on Windows) and this side reads\nand writes the raw buffers, so no locale default is ever consulted (a Chinese\nWindows box defaults to GBK, a C-locale POSIX box to ASCII).\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nfrom ..config import Config\nfrom .registry import build_default_tools\nfrom .workspace import LocalWorkspace\n\n\ndef _run(payload: dict) -> dict:\n    name = payload[\"name\"]\n    config = Config(\n        mode=payload.get(\"mode\", \"work\"),\n        read_max_chars=payload.get(\"read_max_chars\", 20000),\n    )\n    workspace = LocalWorkspace(payload[\"workspace_root\"])\n    # protection lives in a parent-side in-memory set; a fresh Workspace does\n    # not have it, so the parent ships its snapshot and we re-apply it BEFORE\n    # the tool runs (read_file/write_file refuse protected paths)\n    for p in payload.get(\"protected\", []):\n        workspace.protect(Path(p))\n    tool = {t.name: t for t in build_default_tools(config)}.get(name)\n    if tool is None:\n        # memory tools are closures over the parent's MemoryStore and are\n        # never migrated; any other unknown name is a parent-side bug\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: unknown tool {name!r}\", \"error\": True}\n    return tool.func(workspace, config, **payload.get(\"args\", {}))\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    try:\n        raw = sys.stdin.buffer.read()\n        out = json.dumps(_run(json.loads(raw.decode(\"utf-8\"))), ensure_ascii=False)\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 -- report to the parent as data\n        out = json.dumps({\"content\": f\"ERROR: cli crashed: {e}\", \"error\": True}, ensure_ascii=False)\n    sys.stdout.buffer.write(out.encode(\"utf-8\"))\n    sys.stdout.buffer.flush()\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())\n", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789877969.8571148, "id": "308e1e352f15", "content": "完整链路 6 步，从「模型吐出 arguments 字符串」到「`tool.func` 被调用」，全部是确切代码（跳过流式拼接，`tool_calls` 已经是拼好的完整列表）：\n\n## 1. loop.py:205-214 — arguments 原样装进事件（还是 JSON 字符串）\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:205-214\nif tool_calls:\n    tc_events: list[ToolCallEvent] = []\n    for tc in tool_calls:\n        tc_events.append(\n            ToolCallEvent(\n                name=tc[\"name\"],\n                arguments=tc[\"arguments\"],   # ← 此时仍是 raw JSON 字符串\n                tool_call_id=tc[\"id\"],\n            )\n        )\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/events.py:73-78\n@dataclass\nclass ToolCallEvent(Event):\n    type: str = \"tool_call\"\n    name: str = \"\"\n    arguments: str = \"\"  # raw JSON string\n    tool_call_id: str = \"\"\n```\n\n## 2. loop.py:235-242 → 277-295 — 逐个事件执行：解析 + 权限 + 交给 registry\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:235,242\nfor ev in tc_events:\n    ...\n    result = self._execute_tool(ev)\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:277-295\ndef _execute_tool(self, ev: ToolCallEvent) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    try:\n        args = parse_arguments(ev.arguments)            # ① 字符串 → dict\n    except ParseError as e:\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: {e.message}\", \"error\": True}\n    args_repr = ev.arguments\n    if self.gate is not None:\n        try:\n            self.gate.require(ev.name, args_repr, self.workspace)   # ② 权限门\n        except PermissionRequired as e:\n            return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: {e.reason}\", \"error\": True}\n    try:\n        return self.registry.execute(\n            self.workspace, self.config, ev.name, args, cancel=self.cancel\n        )                                                # ③ workspace/config 在这里注入\n    finally:\n        self.workspace.clear_allowed()\n```\n\n**关键点①：** `workspace` 和 `config` 不来自模型——它们是 `Agent` 的成员，由 loop 显式递给 `execute`。模型只贡献 `name` 和 `args`。\n\n**关键点②（唯一的字符串→dict 转换）：**\n\n```python\n# agent/core/parse.py:23-33\ndef parse_arguments(raw: str) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    try:\n        data = json.loads(raw)\n    except json.JSONDecodeError as e:\n        raise ParseError(...) from e\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        raise ParseError(...)\n    return data\n```\n\n## 3. registry.py:349-386 — `**args` 解包，三条调用分支\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:349-386\ndef execute(self, workspace, config, name, args, cancel=None) -> dict:\n    tool = self._tools.get(name)\n    if tool is None:\n        return {...unknown_tool...}\n    try:\n        args = self._coerce_types(tool, args)        # ④ 按 schema 矫正类型\n        use_child = (\n            tool.subprocess\n            and not getattr(sys, \"frozen\", False)\n            and isinstance(workspace, LocalWorkspace)\n        )\n        if use_child:\n            result = self._exec_subprocess(workspace, config, name, args, cancel)\n        elif self._cancelable.get(name):\n            result = tool.func(workspace, config, cancel=cancel, **args)   # ⑤\n        else:\n            result = tool.func(workspace, config, **args)                  # ⑥\n    except TypeError as e:\n        result = {\"content\": render(\"errors/invalid_arguments.md\", error=e), \"error\": True}\n    ...\n```\n\n**关键点③（`_coerce_types`，模型有时把整数传成字符串）：**\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:471-483\n@staticmethod\ndef _coerce_types(tool: Tool, args: dict[str, Any]) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    props = tool.parameters.get(\"properties\", {})\n    for key, spec in props.items():\n        if key not in args:\n            continue\n        if spec.get(\"type\") == \"integer\" and not isinstance(args[key], int):\n            try:\n                args[key] = int(args[key])\n            except (TypeError, ValueError):\n                pass\n    return args\n```\n\n## 4. 注入 ToolImpl 的绑定机制\n\n`tool.func` 适配器只是把 `(workspace, config)` 前置，其余全靠 `**kw` 透传：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:88\nfunc=lambda sb, cfg, **kw: filesystem.read_file(sb, cfg, **kw),\n```\n\n落到具体函数签名——**模型 JSON 的 key 名 == 函数的具名形参名**，`**args` 解包自动对号入座：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/filesystem.py:21-28\ndef read_file(\n    workspace: Workspace,\n    config: Config,\n    path: str,            # ← args[\"path\"]\n    max_chars: int = 0,   # ← args[\"max_chars\"]（缺省时用默认值）\n    offset: int = 0,      # ← args[\"offset\"]\n    limit: int = 0,       # ← args[\"limit\"]\n) -> dict:\n```\n\n多传一个模型编出来的 key（schema 里没有的）会 `TypeError` → 被 `execute` 捕获喂回 `invalid_arguments.md` 让模型自纠。\n\n**`cancel` 不来自模型**，是框架探测签名后注入的：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:340-341\nself._cancelable = {\n    name: \"cancel\" in inspect.signature(t.func).parameters for name, t in self._tools.items()\n}\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/shell.py:209\ndef run_command(workspace: Workspace, config: Config, command: str,\n                cancel: threading.Event | None = None) -> dict:\n```\n\n## 5. subprocess 分支（`read_file` 走这条）\n\n`read_file` 声明了 `subprocess=True`（registry.py:89），本地非冻结环境走 `_exec_subprocess`：args 序列化进 stdin JSON——\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:406-414\npayload = json.dumps(\n    {\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"args\": args,                      # ← 还是那个 dict\n        \"workspace_root\": str(workspace.root),\n        \"mode\": config.mode,\n        \"read_max_chars\": config.read_max_chars,\n        \"protected\": [str(p) for p in workspace.protected()],\n    },\n```\n\n子进程 `agent/tools/cli.py:38-56` 重建 workspace/config 后，用**同一个 `**args` 解包**调到真正的函数：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/cli.py:53-56\ntool = {t.name: t for t in build_default_tools(config)}.get(name)\nif tool is None:\n    return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: unknown tool {name!r}\", \"error\": True}\nreturn tool.func(workspace, config, **payload.get(\"args\", {}))\n```\n\n## 一图总结\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"模型输出<br/>arguments: raw JSON string\"] --> B[\"parse_arguments<br/>json.loads → dict\"]\n    B --> C[\"gate.require<br/>权限检查\"]\n    C --> D[\"registry.execute<br/>_coerce_types 按 schema 矫正\"]\n    D --> E[\"tool.func(workspace, config, **args)\"]\n    E --> F[\"** 解包 → 具名形参<br/>key名 == 形参名\"]\n```\n\n所以「参数从模型到 ToolImpl」的本质就三行：\n\n1. **字符串→dict**：`loop.py:280` `args = parse_arguments(ev.arguments)`（唯一一次 JSON 解析）\n2. **框架注入**：`registry.py:376/378` `tool.func(workspace, config, **args)` —— workspace/config 由 loop 持有递进来，cancel 按 `inspect.signature` 探测注入\n3. **key→形参绑定**：`**args` 解包，靠「JSON Schema 的 property 名 == 函数形参名」这个约定完成，无任何反射注册表", "tool_calls": [], "reasoning": "Now I have everything. Compose the answer in Chinese, exact code with file:line, no streaming parts. Structure as a numbered chain with code blocks. Keep it focused: model → ToolImpl injection."}
{"type": "final", "timestamp": 1789877969.8591087, "id": "685042d52f95", "status": "completed", "summary": "完整链路 6 步，从「模型吐出 arguments 字符串」到「`tool.func` 被调用」，全部是确切代码（跳过流式拼接，`tool_calls` 已经是拼好的完整列表）：\n\n## 1. loop.py:205-214 — arguments 原样装进事件（还是 JSON 字符串）\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:205-214\nif tool_calls:\n    tc_events: list[ToolCallEvent] = []\n    for tc in tool_calls:\n        tc_events.append(\n            ToolCallEvent(\n                name=tc[\"name\"],\n                arguments=tc[\"arguments\"],   # ← 此时仍是 raw JSON 字符串\n                tool_call_id=tc[\"id\"],\n            )\n        )\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/events.py:73-78\n@dataclass\nclass ToolCallEvent(Event):\n    type: str = \"tool_call\"\n    name: str = \"\"\n    arguments: str = \"\"  # raw JSON string\n    tool_call_id: str = \"\"\n```\n\n## 2. loop.py:235-242 → 277-295 — 逐个事件执行：解析 + 权限 + 交给 registry\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:235,242\nfor ev in tc_events:\n    ...\n    result = self._execute_tool(ev)\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/loop.py:277-295\ndef _execute_tool(self, ev: ToolCallEvent) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    try:\n        args = parse_arguments(ev.arguments)            # ① 字符串 → dict\n    except ParseError as e:\n        return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: {e.message}\", \"error\": True}\n    args_repr = ev.arguments\n    if self.gate is not None:\n        try:\n            self.gate.require(ev.name, args_repr, self.workspace)   # ② 权限门\n        except PermissionRequired as e:\n            return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: {e.reason}\", \"error\": True}\n    try:\n        return self.registry.execute(\n            self.workspace, self.config, ev.name, args, cancel=self.cancel\n        )                                                # ③ workspace/config 在这里注入\n    finally:\n        self.workspace.clear_allowed()\n```\n\n**关键点①：** `workspace` 和 `config` 不来自模型——它们是 `Agent` 的成员，由 loop 显式递给 `execute`。模型只贡献 `name` 和 `args`。\n\n**关键点②（唯一的字符串→dict 转换）：**\n\n```python\n# agent/core/parse.py:23-33\ndef parse_arguments(raw: str) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    try:\n        data = json.loads(raw)\n    except json.JSONDecodeError as e:\n        raise ParseError(...) from e\n    if not isinstance(data, dict):\n        raise ParseError(...)\n    return data\n```\n\n## 3. registry.py:349-386 — `**args` 解包，三条调用分支\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:349-386\ndef execute(self, workspace, config, name, args, cancel=None) -> dict:\n    tool = self._tools.get(name)\n    if tool is None:\n        return {...unknown_tool...}\n    try:\n        args = self._coerce_types(tool, args)        # ④ 按 schema 矫正类型\n        use_child = (\n            tool.subprocess\n            and not getattr(sys, \"frozen\", False)\n            and isinstance(workspace, LocalWorkspace)\n        )\n        if use_child:\n            result = self._exec_subprocess(workspace, config, name, args, cancel)\n        elif self._cancelable.get(name):\n            result = tool.func(workspace, config, cancel=cancel, **args)   # ⑤\n        else:\n            result = tool.func(workspace, config, **args)                  # ⑥\n    except TypeError as e:\n        result = {\"content\": render(\"errors/invalid_arguments.md\", error=e), \"error\": True}\n    ...\n```\n\n**关键点③（`_coerce_types`，模型有时把整数传成字符串）：**\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:471-483\n@staticmethod\ndef _coerce_types(tool: Tool, args: dict[str, Any]) -> dict[str, Any]:\n    props = tool.parameters.get(\"properties\", {})\n    for key, spec in props.items():\n        if key not in args:\n            continue\n        if spec.get(\"type\") == \"integer\" and not isinstance(args[key], int):\n            try:\n                args[key] = int(args[key])\n            except (TypeError, ValueError):\n                pass\n    return args\n```\n\n## 4. 注入 ToolImpl 的绑定机制\n\n`tool.func` 适配器只是把 `(workspace, config)` 前置，其余全靠 `**kw` 透传：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:88\nfunc=lambda sb, cfg, **kw: filesystem.read_file(sb, cfg, **kw),\n```\n\n落到具体函数签名——**模型 JSON 的 key 名 == 函数的具名形参名**，`**args` 解包自动对号入座：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/filesystem.py:21-28\ndef read_file(\n    workspace: Workspace,\n    config: Config,\n    path: str,            # ← args[\"path\"]\n    max_chars: int = 0,   # ← args[\"max_chars\"]（缺省时用默认值）\n    offset: int = 0,      # ← args[\"offset\"]\n    limit: int = 0,       # ← args[\"limit\"]\n) -> dict:\n```\n\n多传一个模型编出来的 key（schema 里没有的）会 `TypeError` → 被 `execute` 捕获喂回 `invalid_arguments.md` 让模型自纠。\n\n**`cancel` 不来自模型**，是框架探测签名后注入的：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:340-341\nself._cancelable = {\n    name: \"cancel\" in inspect.signature(t.func).parameters for name, t in self._tools.items()\n}\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/shell.py:209\ndef run_command(workspace: Workspace, config: Config, command: str,\n                cancel: threading.Event | None = None) -> dict:\n```\n\n## 5. subprocess 分支（`read_file` 走这条）\n\n`read_file` 声明了 `subprocess=True`（registry.py:89），本地非冻结环境走 `_exec_subprocess`：args 序列化进 stdin JSON——\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/registry.py:406-414\npayload = json.dumps(\n    {\n        \"name\": name,\n        \"args\": args,                      # ← 还是那个 dict\n        \"workspace_root\": str(workspace.root),\n        \"mode\": config.mode,\n        \"read_max_chars\": config.read_max_chars,\n        \"protected\": [str(p) for p in workspace.protected()],\n    },\n```\n\n子进程 `agent/tools/cli.py:38-56` 重建 workspace/config 后，用**同一个 `**args` 解包**调到真正的函数：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/cli.py:53-56\ntool = {t.name: t for t in build_default_tools(config)}.get(name)\nif tool is None:\n    return {\"content\": f\"ERROR: unknown tool {name!r}\", \"error\": True}\nreturn tool.func(workspace, config, **payload.get(\"args\", {}))\n```\n\n## 一图总结\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A[\"模型输出<br/>arguments: raw JSON string\"] --> B[\"parse_arguments<br/>json.loads → dict\"]\n    B --> C[\"gate.require<br/>权限检查\"]\n    C --> D[\"registry.execute<br/>_coerce_types 按 schema 矫正\"]\n    D --> E[\"tool.func(workspace, config, **args)\"]\n    E --> F[\"** 解包 → 具名形参<br/>key名 == 形参名\"]\n```\n\n所以「参数从模型到 ToolImpl」的本质就三行：\n\n1. **字符串→dict**：`loop.py:280` `args = parse_arguments(ev.arguments)`（唯一一次 JSON 解析）\n2. **框架注入**：`registry.py:376/378` `tool.func(workspace, config, **args)` —— workspace/config 由 loop 持有递进来，cancel 按 `inspect.signature` 探测注入\n3. **key→形参绑定**：`**args` 解包，靠「JSON Schema 的 property 名 == 函数形参名」这个约定完成，无任何反射注册表"}
