{"type": "assistant_message", "timestamp": 1789878617.1093776, "id": "47cbea70b7c8", "content": "这个问题正好切在「上一轮 `**args` 解包」的**下一层**。核心结论先说：\n\n**bash 指令不拆参数。** 模型给的 `command` 是**一整条字符串**，agent 原封不动交给 `bash -c <整串>`，拆词分词是 bash 自己干的活。agent 只在**安全审判**时才把字符串拆成 token——拆出来的结果只用来判断，**从不用于执行**。\n\n## 1. 入口：command 就是一个普通字符串参数\n\n经上轮那条链路解包后落到这里：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/shell.py:209\ndef run_command(workspace: Workspace, config: Config,\n                command: str, cancel: threading.Event | None = None) -> dict:\n```\n\n模型调用 `run_command({\"command\": \"grep -rn 'pattern' . && wc -l x\"})`，`command` 的值就是**带引号、带 `&&`、带管道的完整 shell 文本**，agent 不做任何结构化。\n\n## 2. 判定用拆词 vs 执行用原串——两条路\n\n**拆词只为了安全审判**（shell.py:232，注释明说不用它来执行）：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/shell.py:229-244\n# Path escape guard: reject tokens resolving outside the workspace.\n# split_command (not raw shlex): on a cmd-flavored host the POSIX lexer\n# would eat the backslashes out of C:\\ paths and mis-judge every verdict.\nargs = split_command(command, posix)        # ← 拆出来的 args 只在这里用\nif args is None:\n    return {\"content\": \"ERROR: command cannot be parsed (unbalanced quotes?)\", \"error\": True}\nfor tok in args:\n    p = workspace.resolve(workspace.shell_path(tok))   # 逐 token 查越界\n    ...\n    if workspace.is_protected(p): ...\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/localshell.py:114\ndef split_command(command: str, posix: bool | None = None) -> list[str] | None:\n```\n\nPOSIX 方言用 `shlex`，Windows cmd 方言按 `CommandLineToArgvW` 规则（localshell.py:18 注释）。\n\n## 3. 执行：整串递给 workspace → transport → Popen\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/shell.py:258\nr = workspace.run(command, config.command_timeout, cancel=cancel)\n```\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/workspace.py:272-275\ndef run(self, command: str, timeout: float, cancel=None) -> CommandResult:\n    return self._transport.run(command, timeout, cancel=cancel)\n```\n\n**真正的传参就这一行**（transport.py:124-126）：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/transport.py:122-133\nshell = local_shell()\nproc = subprocess.Popen(\n    [*shell.argv, command] if shell.argv else command,\n    shell=shell.argv is None,\n    cwd=self.cwd,\n    stdout=subprocess.PIPE,\n    stderr=subprocess.PIPE,\n    start_new_session=os.name == \"posix\",\n)\n```\n\n## 4. `shell.argv` 决定三种 spawn 形态（localshell.py:76-85）\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/localshell.py:76-85\ndef _detect() -> LocalShell:\n    if os.name != \"nt\":\n        return LocalShell(argv=None, posix=True, name=\"posix-sh\")\n    ...\n    if _probe_bash(cand):\n        return LocalShell(argv=(cand, \"-c\"), posix=True, name=\"bash\")\n    return LocalShell(argv=None, posix=False, name=\"cmd\")\n```\n\n| 形态 | argv | Popen 实际收到 | 谁来拆词 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| POSIX 主机 | `None` | `Popen(\"cmd str\", shell=True)` → `/bin/sh -c` | sh |\n| Windows + Git Bash（本机现状） | `(bash.exe, \"-c\")` | `Popen([bash.exe, \"-c\", \"cmd str\"])` | bash |\n| Windows 无 bash | `None` | `Popen(\"cmd str\", shell=True)` → cmd.exe | cmd |\n\n本机就是第二种：**整条命令字符串是 argv 的最后一个元素**，`bash -c` 接到后按 POSIX 语义自己做引号解析、管道、`&&` 展开——`/tmp`→`%TEMP%` 这种映射也是 bash（MSYS）层面自己做的，agent 不碰。\n\n## 5. 远程方案：字符串原样过网\n\nSSH/exec-bridge 路径下同样不拆，整串进 JSON：\n\n```python\n# agent/tools/transport.py:195-203\nbody = json.dumps({\"command\": command, \"timeout\": int(timeout * 1000), \"binary\": binary})\nreq = urllib.request.Request(\n    self.bridge_url + \"/exec\",\n    data=body,\n    ...\n)\n```\n\nbridge 把 `POST /exec` 转成 ssh exec channel（transport.py:180-187 文档），由**远端的登录 shell**（永远按 POSIX 判定，workspace.py:512-513）解析执行。\n\n## 一图总结\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    M[\"模型: command = 整条字符串\"] --> A[\"shell.py:232 split_command<br/>仅安全审判: 越界/保护文件\"]\n    M --> B[\"shell.py:258 workspace.run(command)\"]\n    B --> C[\"transport.py:125<br/>argv = [bash, -c, command]\"]\n    C --> D[\"bash 自己拆词/引号/管道<br/>agent 不参与\"]\n    M -.远程.-> E[\"transport.py:195<br/>JSON 整串 → ssh exec channel\"]\n```\n\n所以两层分工很清楚：\n\n- **agent 拆词**（`split_command`）→ 只为「这个 token 是不是越界路径/保护文件/交互式命令」，是 `classify` 语义，不是 `exec`