{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789893121.4670978, "id": "5f79626905e9", "tool_call_id": "call_ac97a531349c492b8f0d5382", "content": "OK: wrote C:\\Users\\12741\\Desktop\\临时文件\\Clutch\\clutch-workspace\\clutch_workspace\\envelope.py (1570 chars)", "is_error": false, "diff": "--- a/clutch-workspace\\clutch_workspace\\envelope.py\n+++ b/clutch-workspace\\clutch_workspace\\envelope.py\n@@ -0,0 +1,52 @@\n+\"\"\"Output contract: human text vs the --json machine envelope.\n+\n+Two modes, one Result shape:\n+- human:  content (+ diff) on stdout; errors go to stderr as `ERROR: <brief>`\n+- --json: ONE compact JSON line on stdout, always\n+          {\"content\": str, \"error\": bool, \"diff\": str}\n+          errors use the same envelope with error=true, diff=\"\", and a\n+          non-zero exit code — callers parse stdout, never prose.\n+\"\"\"\n+\n+from __future__ import annotations\n+\n+import json\n+import sys\n+from dataclasses import dataclass\n+\n+\n+@dataclass\n+class Result:\n+    \"\"\"A successful command outcome: content plus an optional unified diff.\"\"\"\n+\n+    content: str\n+    diff: str = \"\"\n+\n+\n+class CommandError(Exception):\n+    \"\"\"A failed command: sysexits code (see exitcodes) plus a brief message.\"\"\"\n+\n+    def __init__(self, code: int, message: str) -> None:\n+        super().__init__(message)\n+        self.code = code\n+        self.message = message\n+\n+\n+def _write_line(text: str) -> None:\n+    sys.stdout.write(text + \"\\n\")\n+\n+\n+def emit_result(res: Result, as_json: bool) -> None:\n+    if as_json:\n+        _write_line(json.dumps({\"content\": res.content, \"error\": False, \"diff\": res.diff}, ensure_ascii=False))\n+        return\n+    sys.stdout.write(res.content + \"\\n\")\n+    if res.diff:\n+        sys.stdout.write(res.diff if res.diff.endswith(\"\\n\") else res.diff + \"\\n\")\n+\n+\n+def emit_error(err: CommandError, as_json: bool) -> None:\n+    if as_json:\n+        _write_line(json.dumps({\"content\": err.message, \"error\": True, \"diff\": \"\"}, ensure_ascii=False))\n+        return\n+    sys.stderr.write(f\"ERROR: {err.message}\\n\")\n"}
{"type": "compaction", "timestamp": 1789893158.2751708, "id": "f713a3b08a99", "summary": "## Objective\n- 落地已冻结的解耦计划：新建独立零依赖 Python CLI 项目 `clutch-workspace`（read_file / grep / write_file / edit_file 四个子命令），不感知调用方\n- 用户要求：中途遇到需决策的技术点必须交用户拍板，不得静默执行\n\n## Important Details\n- 冻结契约：`--path x` 空格风格；全局 `--json` 信封 `{content,error,diff}`（必须在子命令**之前**）；sysexits 退出码 0/64/65/66/70/74/130；纯能力无越界保护——路径相对**进程 CWD** 解析（「workspace」语义由调用方选 cwd 实现）；host 一行不动\n- 错误信息：CLI 只出错误码+简讯（Q16），`errors/*.md` prose 留 host；内容通道格式（续读提示、`(no matches)`、`(empty directory)`、`Line N:` 等）逐字节平移保真\n- 大参数通道：flag 值为 `-` 时读 stdin（W3，Windows 32K argv 上限）；`--max-chars` 默认 20000；v1 零配置文件；UTF-8 强制\n- 工程约定镜像 host：hatchling、ruff line-length 120、py310、dev 组 pytest；新仓可用 pytest（host 仍无 pytest），已建 `clutch-workspace/.venv` 并装好 pytest 9.1.1（清华镜像，首次 30s 超时，重试成功）\n- 语义基准已核实：`LocalWorkspace.read` = `read_text(utf-8, replace)`；`write` = `write_text(utf-8, newline=\"\\n\")` 父目录自动创建；grep 走 100 上限、跳过 `.` 开头与 `__pycache__`、1024 字节含 `\\x00` 判二进制、fnmatch 匹配 name 或 rel\n- 曾经历 C++/shell/w64devkit 决策摇摆，最终定 Python；记忆 \"clutch-workspace C++ spin-off: frozen decisions\" 已更新为 Python 版\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- 决策问卷 34 题全部拍板并归档（Python、独立仓库、纯能力、4 子命令、--json、sysexits、stdin 大参数等）\n- 环境定案：本机无 C++ 编译器（W1 因转 Python 作废）；`/c/Python314` 在 PATH；venv + pytest 9.1.1 就绪\n- 语义基准提取完毕：`agent/tools/filesystem.py` 全文 + `workspace.py:349-460`（read/write/list/grep 实现体）\n- 骨架已写入 `clutch-workspace/`：`pyproject.toml`（hatchling/console script `clutch-workspace = clutch_workspace.cli:main`/dev pytest/ruff 配置）、`.gitignore`、`clutch_workspace/__init__.py`（0.1.0）、`exitcodes.py`（sysexits 表+docstring）、`envelope.py`（Result/CommandError/emit_result/emit_error，--json 单行紧凑 JSON 走 stdout、human 模式错误走 stderr）\n\n### Active\n- 待写：`filesystem.py`（四命令平移：read_file 含目录列表/行号范围/截断续读指针/超预算报错；grep 含 100 上限+页脚/隐藏与 `__pycache__` 跳过/二进制跳过/include fnmatch/逐组空行分隔/300 字符截行；write_file 含 diff+±行摘要/parents 自动创建/edit 的 0 次与 >1 次分码报错）、`cli.py`（argparse 子命令接线、`--json` 全局前置、`_stdin_value` 处理 `-`、自定义 `error()` 让 usage 错退 64 而非 argparse 默认 2、BrokenPipeError→74、KeyboardInterrupt→130、兜底→70、stdout/stderr `reconfigure(utf-8)`）、`__main__.py`\n- 待写测试：`tests/conftest.py`（subprocess 黑盒跑 `python -m clutch_workspace`，PYTHONPATH 指仓根）、`test_cli.py`/`test_read.py`/`test_grep.py`/`test_write.py`/`test_edit.py`\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. 写 `filesystem.py` + `cli.py` + `__main__.py`，随后写全部测试文件\n2. 用 `.venv/Scripts/python.exe -m pytest` 跑绿 → `git init` + 首次提交 → 向用户汇报「错误码分配细目」待复核项（dir+range/坏 regex/超预算 range 的 64 vs 65 归类、argparse 2→64 覆盖、summary 中路径显示 as-given 而非绝对路径）\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `clutch-workspace/`（新仓库根）：已有 pyproject.toml/.gitignore/__init__.py/exitcodes.py/envelope.py\n- `clutch-workspace/clutch_workspace/filesystem.py`：核心待写——四命令语义本体（保真参照 `agent/tools/filesystem.py` 全文）\n- `clutch-workspace/clutch_workspace/cli.py`：待写——argparse/信封/退出码接线\n- `agent/tools/filesystem.py`：平移源（read_file:21-81、grep:174-187、write/edit 语义+空行分组格式+300 截行+100 上限）\n- `agent/tools/workspace.py:349-460`：LocalWorkspace read/write/list/grep 实现体——编码、换行、排序、跳过规则的保真基准\n- `agent/tools/cli.py`：`--json` 单 JSON 对象 stdout + 崩溃走 stderr 的通道分工先例\n- `agent/tools/transport.py:127`：`cwd=self.cwd` ——「cwd 即 workspace」纯能力设计的依据"}
