{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789897368.6047475, "id": "18428fe68430", "tool_call_id": "call_1bf53c29a8714fbc9c7ac870", "content": "[Tool subprocess execution refactor shipped (pilot: read_file)]\nRefactor shipped: tool execution unified behind an opt-in subprocess path. `Tool.subprocess: bool = False` field on the registry dataclass; `ToolRegistry.execute` routes to `_exec_subprocess` when `tool.subprocess AND not frozen AND isinstance(workspace, LocalWorkspace)` (remote/frozen fall back to in-process). New `agent/tools/cli.py`: reads one JSON payload from stdin `{name, args, workspace_root, mode, read_max_chars, protected[]}`, rebuilds Config+LocalWorkspace, re-applies protect() from the parent's `workspace.protected()` snapshot (new 3-line method on base Workspace), calls the same tool func, prints the {content, error, diff} dict as JSON on stdout (exit 0 whenever JSON was produced; parent trusts JSON not exit code). Platform rules baked in: binary pipes (no text=True — Windows newline translation), payload via stdin (no argv 32K/GBK issues), `start_new_session=os.name == \"posix\"` (MANDATORY — without it _kill_tree's killpg would kill the agent's own process group), PYTHONUTF8=1 env for child tracebacks, frozen builds never route to subprocess (sys.executable isn't python). read_file is the first migrated tool (`subprocess=True` pilot). Memory tools (save/load/search) are closures over MemoryStore — never migrated. New `tests/toolcli_test.py` (11 checks incl. cancel tree-kill in ~0.5s, skipped on bash-less hosts via posix_shell_argv()). Regression green: toolcli_test, local_shell_test, selfcheck, server_test full, websearch_test. Downstream (loop.py/PermissionGate/doom-loop/events/{content,error,diff} contract) untouched — diff field is UI-only, content is model-visible.", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789897368.6087477, "id": "a024e39dd4fc", "tool_call_id": "call_958ba402283a4ea08fca6766", "content": "[Two remote schemes: SSH degradation + remote server deploy]\nClutch has TWO remote schemes (user corrected me for describing only one). (A) SSH degradation layer: full agent runs locally; RemoteWorkspace/SshTransport translate file ops to POSIX sh over the Electron exec-bridge (POST /exec → ssh exec); remote needs nothing but sshd; .clc locking degrades to noclobber+TTL because process and files live on different machines. (B) Remote server deployment (ui/ssh-tunnel.js): ssh2 client probes remote platform, uploads a PyInstaller server bundle (SFTP via getSftp, or uploadFileViaExec chunked), starts remote supervisor on :8890 (--idle-timeout 25); each UI window gets forwardOut to its session child port; LLM reached by REVERSE forward (remote :8892 forwardIn → local llm-proxy, key never leaves the machine, remote api_key placeholder \"proxy\" per server.py boot); self-healing via healOnce/restartRemoteServer. In (B) the remote agent is a stock LOCAL deployment (LocalWorkspace, kernel file locks) and does not know it is remote — remote-awareness lives only in ui/main.js, ssh-tunnel.js, llm-proxy.js, server-bundle.js and supervisor lifecycle args. Symmetry: (A) agent knows remote / remote knows nothing; (B) agent knows nothing / UI+tunnel know.", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
{"type": "tool_result", "timestamp": 1789897368.6118174, "id": "b16b84739c54", "tool_call_id": "call_32bf80c3c0064e4e91bb2d5a", "content": "[clutch-workspace M1 committed: 4 decisions ratified]\nclutch-workspace（Python 独立仓，位于 clutch 工作区子文件夹 clutch-workspace/，自有 git）M1 完成并已提交：main 分支两笔聚焦提交 33e5f98(feat: 四命令 CLI + --json 信封 + sysexits) + b97185a(test: 64 黑盒用例)，工作树 clean。\n\n用户拍板落定（与实现零偏差，未改码）：①目录+range 退出码=64 ②坏 regex=64 ③write/edit summary 路径显示 as-given（敲什么显什么；diff 头仍 CWD 相对）④edit_file 双 `-` stdin 拒绝=64。\n\n技术事实：仓库对象存 LF，本机 autocrlf 会提示工作区转 CRLF（无功能影响，可选 .gitattributes 根治）；venv 里无 ruff（pyproject 配置已就位）；老 git 不认 `init -b`，unborn 分支改名用 `git symbolic-ref HEAD refs/heads/main`。\n\n语义要点（测试已锁）：write 落盘 verbatim 不展开 CRLF（newline=\"\\n\"=无翻译，内容自带 \\r 原样保留）；read 目录列表含点文件（只有 grep 藏）；grep 100 上限+组间空行+300 截行；argparse usage 错 2→64；--json 必须在子命令前；UTF-8 强制三流。\n\n未做/后置：host 接线（Q21/31-33 冻结后置）；远程仓未建（W2 open，push 走 HTTPS+credential.manager 的 PAT，见「Clutch push/release conventions」）；PyPI/PyInstaller 打包后置。", "is_error": false, "diff": ""}
